<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="2.6">
  <book code="REV" style="id">Baebu Thyaa</book>
  <para style="h">BYAPHY</para>
  <para style="toc1">Revelation</para>
  <para style="toc2">BYAPHY</para>
  <para style="toc3">Bya</para>
  <para style="mt1">BYAPHY</para>
  <para style="mt2">Revelation</para>
  <para style="imt">Byalaanmaw</para>
  <para style="ip">
    <char style="bk">Johan kya Langsakupaw Byaphy</char> hynh Jesu Khri tuh Bawipaw nynh thua cite Khriccaaw hae mih zynnaw keiccuze vawsaw a teing lya hae ze zeipaw nynh thua. Ccawzeitu nynh a eenaw tuh a ccawriatu hae ngaehoinaw te thawzung pyanaw, vawsawnaw te runaw ccyh kya balyn zynnaw kya atyn nawlan hae hyynawpaw nynh thua.</para>
  <para style="ip">E ccauh lungkhu e alunghua tuh tuin ccyh lya-e Khriccaaw hae hanlan thua leite ccangpaw ccungccaw hae hanlan thaethya arupaw byakhupaw te a hopaw byaphy hae te vizin hae patae a um. E ccauh abyalupi hae hynh vizin aphuinphuin te avae patae atu te atu a langsaku. E ccauh ccaesahnaw kong te kyngkuh zah tuanaw aphuinphuin um salamah a abyalupi a lungdy tuh: Pachia nynh Khri Bawipaw kha mangte a rhaw hae te Satan kha marya yn tae cih zah taenaw yn ccing te, amaw zyntu hae tuh vaaw thawpaw te laephi thawpaw ccounaw hythuanaw lasung kha yn pya cih hae, cipaw nynh thua.</para>
  <para style="iot">Alungkhu Umpaw</para>
  <para style="io1">Byalaanmaw — 1.1-8</para>
  <para style="io1">Vizin athotakawnaw te khriccaawbuu hae buu sari kalan ccaky — 1.9—3.22</para>
  <para style="io1">Ccakue te tazeih ccangsari — 4.1—8.1</para>
  <para style="io1">Mungkae ccangsari — 8.2—11.19</para>
  <para style="io1">Hupi te sarepaw sa ning — 12.1—13.18</para>
  <para style="io1">Vizin aphuinphuin — 14.1—15.8</para>
  <para style="io1">Pachia thinrianaw pakekhupaw ccangsari — 16.1-21</para>
  <para style="io1">Babilon ronaw, sarepaw shungnaw, lingthya profeh te Satan — 17.1—20.10</para>
  <para style="io1">Nyathya byapianaw — 20.11-15</para>
  <para style="io1">Vaaw thawpaw, laephi thawpaw, Jerusalem thawpaw — 21.1—22.5</para>
  <para style="io1">Athangnaw — 22.6-21</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />E ccauh tuh Jesu Khri kya-e byaphy nynh thua, aro mawze solei yn cyihkuh cih paw uccaw hae kha a ryalahtu hae kalan langsahpya khylan Pachia nynh Khri kalan a pyapaw byaphy nynh thua. Khri nynh a vaaw ccungccapaw kha saw zah a seepaw Johan kha tuh-e byaphy tuh a nysah. <verse number="2" style="v" />Johan nynh Pachia bya te Jesu Khri kya-e ccaekia te a muihpaw balyn kha ccaekia a khan.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Hynh-e profehbya hae hynh a ria paw, a thae hae paw te tuin kya azeikuhpaw kha a zui hae paw tuh hythuaccou hae paw nynh thua hae; pawccecize accyh tuh anae vae.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="s1">Khriccaawbuu Buu Sari kalan Beihlangnaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Kae, Johan nynh Asia ram kya umpaw khriccaawbuu buu sari kha kae beihlang oh. Atu lya a umpaw, langmawlya a la um vae paw te malang zemah a um cih paw amaw kyate thuasah, a bawitungkhung malang a um hae paw muisaw hae ccangsari kyate thuasah, <verse number="5" style="v" />a lungzipaw ccaekia a thuapaw, a chih hae paw kyate masaty yn puipaw te laephi siapharan hae uktu bawi athuapaw Jesu Khri kyate thuasah thawccinaw te daenaw tuh nae tungvaw la um sah. Aening kha oun sungsah zah a chiise te aening seinaw balyn kha oun luesahpaw, <verse number="6" style="v" />aening hanlan peenaw kha oun raepah zah a Paaw te a Pachia malang khe ranpibawi hae lang oun raetupaw tungvaw kya phu-enaw te uknaw kaw tuh zungzae te zungzae cia la um sah. Amen.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Dotua oh, Khri tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">maeking te nynh yn thua,</para>
  <para style="q1">ccungccaw miakaw te amaw</para>
  <para style="q2">a thuingtu hae nynh</para>
  <para style="q1">amaw kha a muih cih hae;</para>
  <para style="q2">laephi vaw e minphuin hae balyn tuh</para>
  <para style="q1">amaw keiccuze</para>
  <para style="q2">a rah a khui cih hae.</para>
  <para style="p">Ou tuhmawte nynh thua, Amen.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Bawipaw Pachia nynh, “Kae tuh Alfa te Omega nynh ka thua,” a ci. Aning tuh atu lya a umpaw, langmawlya a la um vae paw te malang zemah a um cih paw, Athung Huaccepaw nynh thua.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="s1">Johan Vizin kya-e Khri</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Jesu Khri kya-e vawsawrunaw, peenaw te ngaesangnaw kya nanning ry a mungkuh buapaw, nae upaw kae, Johan tuh Pachia bya keiccu te Jesu Khri ccaekia lang ka tang keiccuze Patmos cikuhpaw tuikoih kya ka um. <verse number="10" style="v" />Bawipaw Nin kya kae tuh Muisaw kya ka um zah, ka nulang khe mungkae roi hawte myarya accaepaw roi kha ka thae. <verse number="11" style="v" />Tuh-e roi nynh, “Na muihpaw kha ccauh kya zei lah, Asia ram e Efesa khua, Smyrna khua, Perkamum khua, Thiatira khua, Sardis khua, Filadelfia khua te Laodisia khua kya umpaw khriccaawbuu buu sari kalan ky hae,” a ci.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Bya yn hopah zah roi a sawtupaw kha muih khylan he ka maeleihkuh tuh, sui maeekhuatung ccangsari, <verse number="13" style="v" />te maeekhuatung ccangsari angaelung khe Ccungccaw Ccapaw alopaw lu kheit kha ka muih; tuh-e paw tuh angkiccua kha kikuh zah a by kyakhe sui taeccia te a cciakuh.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1.13: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 7:13">Dan 7.13</ref>, <ref loc="DAN 10:5">10.5</ref></char></note> <verse number="14" style="v" />A lu te a sang tuh tuuming te vuiraw hawte araw; a mit tuh maeesoi hawte nynh thua.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1.14-15: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 7:9">Dan 7.9</ref>, <ref loc="DAN 10:6">10.6</ref></char></note> <verse number="15" style="v" />A ccu tuh maeesopi kya a phung vae hae paw thyaararihpaw sohin nynh alo, a roi tuh tuiphue patae roi accaepaw nynh alo.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1.15: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 1:24">Eze 1.24</ref>, <ref loc="EZK 43:2">43.2</ref></char></note> <verse number="16" style="v" />A ranglang kuih kya awsi ccangsari a ccyng; a khalang lungkhu te kyn ning mawte ahepaw thaloi a pou; a maesue tuh thawzung phe beih lante apawpaw khuanin hawte nynh thua.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Amaw kha he ka muih tuh, a cculeihpaw khe achihpaw hawte ka khuliakuh. Thuasalama a ranglang kuih kha ka tungvaw khe khang zah, “Rih nan, kae tuh masaty te nyathyakou nynh ka thua;<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1.17: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 44:6">Isa 44.6</ref>, <ref loc="ISA 48:12">48.12</ref>; <ref loc="REV 2:8">Bya 2.8</ref>, <ref loc="REV 22:13">22.13</ref></char></note> <verse number="18" style="v" />a hiinpaw mah ka thua; kae tuh ka la chih, thuasalama dotua, kae tuh zungzae te zungzae cia po a hiinpaw nynh ka thua, Chinaw toh te Michi khua toh kha ka hoi. <verse number="19" style="v" />Tukeiccuze na muihpaw uccaw hae, atu lya a umpaw uccaw hae te malang yn cyihkuh cih paw uccaw hae kha zei. <verse number="20" style="v" />Ka ranglang kuih kya na muihpaw awsi ccangsari te sui maeekhuatung ccangsari nynh a ho rypaw byakhupaw tuh hynhte nynh thua: Awsi ccangsari tuh khriccaawbuu buu sari kya-e vaaw hae nynh thua; na muihpaw maeekhuatung ccangsari tuh khriccaawbuu buu sari kha nynh thua.</para>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Efesa Khriccaawbuu kalan Byataw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />“Efesa khua umpaw khriccaawbuu kya-e vaawpaw kalan hynhte zei: A ranglang kuih kya awsi ccangsari a ccyngtupaw, sui maeekhuatung ccangsari hae laku kya a cceihtupaw nynh hynhte a ho.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Na ryalaw hae, thawte rya na lawpaw te na ngaesangnaw hae kha ka ny, ccungccaw hoylei hae paw kha na ngaesangpah khyh hae cipaw kha thuasah, locceihtu hae nynh kae thua a ci hae zemah locceihtu athua lei hae paw kha akaw-aleih bya na khia hae zah mihyn hae nynh athua hae cipaw kha thuasah nang nynh phe na muih cipaw ka ny; <verse number="3" style="v" />nang tuh ngaesangnaw na hoi zah ka min keiccuze na teing zah na lungthawthang khyh cipaw ka ny. <verse number="4" style="v" />Thuasalama nang kha kae ccaenaw a um, pawccecize masaty na hoipaw sungsahnaw kha phe na cciataw vae. <verse number="5" style="v" />Tukeiccuze paw kyate nynh ka khuliaku cipaw kha liathui lah, ngaesikute masaty e na ryalaw kha lawtua. Tukhyhze tuh na kalan arangte kae thua cih zah na ngaesikuh khyh ze, na maeekhuatung kha a umnaw kyate kae nuepah cih. <verse number="6" style="v" />Thuasalama poo lan na ccannaw a um, kae nynh mah ka huapaw Nikolas zuitu hae mih cyisahnaw kha nang nynh na hua. <verse number="7" style="v" />Muisaw nynh khriccaawbuu hae kalan a hopaw kha nakaring a hoipaw ccungccaw tuh thae sah. A taetupaw tuh Pachia kya-e paradis kya umpaw hiinnaw thingthae kha aenaw kaw ka pya cih.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2.7: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 2:9">Gen 2.9</ref>; <ref loc="REV 22:2">Bya 22.2</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 28:13">Eze 28.13</ref>, <ref loc="EZK 31:8">31.8</ref> (LXX)</char></note></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="s1">Smyrna Khriccaawbuu kalan Byataw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />“Smyrna khua kya umpaw khriccaawbuu kya-e vaawpaw kalan hynhte zei: Chih zah bua a hiinpaw, masaty te nyathyakou athuapaw nynh hynhte a ho.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2.8: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 44:6">Isa 44.6</ref>, <ref loc="ISA 48:12">48.12</ref>; <ref loc="REV 1:17">Bya 1.17</ref>, <ref loc="REV 22:13">22.13</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />“Na vawsawnaw te na ryachinaw kha ka ny. Thuasalama nang tuh a hoirumpaw nynh na thua. Judah hae nynh kae thua a ci hae zemah athua lei hae paw, Satan ccungccaw athua hae paw nynh na thethya ae ho hae paw kha ka ny. <verse number="10" style="v" />Na teing lanpaw vawsawnaw kha rih nan. Dotua, nanning tuh syntawnaw teing khylan Satan nynh nanning kyaze abang kha thonginn lungkhu lang a sang cih hae, te nin haw lungkhu vawsawnaw na tung cih oh. Nang tuh chinaw kyacia a lungzipaw la thua, tuhteze tuh hiinnaw bawilukhung kha kae pya cih. <verse number="11" style="v" />Muisaw nynh khriccaawbuu hae kalan a hopaw kha nakaring a hoipaw ccungccaw tuh thae sah. A taetupaw tuh vaening chinaw kha teing vae lan khyh.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2.11: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 20:14">Bya 20.14</ref>, <ref loc="REV 21:8">21.8</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="s1">Perkamum Khriccaawbuu kalan Byataw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />“Perkamum khua kya umpaw khriccaawbuu kya-e vaawpaw kalan hynhte zei: Kyn ning te ahepaw thaloi a hoitupaw nynh hynhte a ho.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />“Na umnaw hmin kha ka ny, tuin kya Satan bawitungkhung a um. A lungzipaw ka ccaekia Antipas tuh Satan a umnaw hmin athuapaw nanning laku chia athua nin kya heize nang tuh ka min kha tynkaring lan na kyngkuh zah kae nae zynnaw kha na vua khyh. <verse number="14" style="v" />Thuasalama nang kha kae ccaenaw ccapyh a um. Pawccecize nae laku kya Balaam ccangpyanaw a kyngkuh hae paw abang a um hae; Israel hae nynh zohtuh hae kalan silawnawpaw uccaw hae kha ae khylan te ohhuakunaw rae khylan mih malang khe thykunawpaw kha nungkhaw khylan Balaam nynh Balak kha a ccangpya.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2.14: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 22:5">Nam 22.5</ref>, <ref loc="NUM 22:7">7</ref>, <ref loc="NUM 31:16">31.16</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 23:4">Deu 23.4</ref>; <ref loc="NUM 25:1-3">Nam 25.1-3</ref></char></note> <verse number="15" style="v" />Tuhawte nae laku kya Nikolas ccangpyanaw a kyngkuh hae paw a um hae. <verse number="16" style="v" />Tukeiccuze ngaesikuh, na ngaesiku khyh ze, na kalan arangte kae thua cih zah ka khalang kya-e thaloi khate minmin kha rhaw ka tuk cih hae. <verse number="17" style="v" />Muisaw nynh khriccaawbuu hae kalan a hopaw kha nakaring a hoipaw ccungccaw tuh thae sah. A taetupaw kha thuruhpaw manna sanlou abang kha ka pya cih, arawpaw lung kha mah ka pya cih, tuh-e lung vawlan khe min thawpaw azeikuh, tuh-e min kha tuh-e lung a muepaw laelan hum nynh san nyh khyh. <note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2.17: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 16:14-15">Exo 16.14-15</ref>, <ref loc="EXO 16:33-34">16.33-34</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 6:48-50">Joh 6.48-50</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 62:2">Isa 62.2</ref>, <ref loc="ISA 65:15">65.15</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="s1">Thiatira Khriccaawbuu kalan Byataw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />“Thiatira khua kya umpaw khriccaawbuu kya-e vaawpaw kalan hynhte zei: Maeesoi alopaw mit a hoitupaw, thyaararihpaw sohin alopaw ccu a hoitupaw Pachia Ccapaw nynh hynhte a ho.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />“Na ryalaw hae, na sungsahnaw, na zynnaw, rya na lawpyanaw te na ngaesangnaw kha ka ny; nyalang e na ryalaw tuh masaty e laeze alunghua cipaw ka ny. <verse number="20" style="v" />Thuasalama nang kha kae ccaenaw a um; pawccecize ka rya yn lawpatu hae kha ohhuakunaw raesah khylan te zohtuh hae kalan silawnawpaw kha aesah khylan ccangpyate hynpah hae zah amaw te amaw kha profehnung a cikuhnung Jezebel kha nang nynh kaw na ua.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2.20: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 16:31">1Si 16.31</ref>; <ref loc="2KI 9:22">2Si 9.22</ref>, <ref loc="2KI 9:30">30</ref></char></note> <verse number="21" style="v" />A ohhuakunaw konglang te ngaesikunaw ccyh ka pya zahmah aning nynh ngaesiku lan phe mya. <verse number="22" style="v" />Dotua, amaw kha ikhung vawlan ka vua cih, te amaw ryte a seikheih hae paw kha mih cyisahnaw a ngaesiku khyh hae lanze, myarya lepaw vawsawrunaw lungkhu lang ka vua cih hae. <verse number="23" style="v" />A ccaaw hae kha chinaw te ka theih cih hae. Kae tuh tuanaw te thinlung a ccungtu nynh ka thua cipaw kha khriccaawbuu hae balyn nynh yn nyh cih hae; nanning milu raveih kha nae ryalaw thyhte kae pya cih oh.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2.23: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 7:9">Sam 7.9</ref>; <ref loc="JER 17:10">Jer 17.10</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 62:12">Sam 62.12</ref></char></note> <verse number="24" style="v" />Thuasalama nae kalan te Thiatira khua kya umpaw tuhlaepaw hae kalan kae hopya oh, tuh-e nopinung ccangpyanaw kha a kyngkuh lei hae paw te ‘Satan kya-e akhupaw uccaw hae,’ cite abang nynh a ho hae paw kha mah a nyh lei hae paw nanning nae tungvaw kya ccangpaw phupaw kha kae khang vae lan khyh oh. <verse number="25" style="v" />Na hoi oh paw kha kamaw kae thua cia varyng kyngkuh oh. <verse number="26" style="v" />Taetu athuapaw te athangnaw cia ka ryalaw a lahpaw tuh,</para>
  <para style="q1">minphuin hae tungvaw</para>
  <para style="q2">kawhoinaw kha ka pya cih;<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2.26-27: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 2:8-9">Sam 2.8-9</ref> (LXX)</char></note></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />aning nynh minmin kha</para>
  <para style="q2">sivaw hoitang te a uk cih hae;</para>
  <para style="q1">laephi ang kha zoihtatyh lan</para>
  <para style="q2">koi hawte minmin kha</para>
  <para style="q1">a koi cih hae; tuh-e tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">kae nynh ka Paaw kyate</para>
  <para style="q2">ka muepaw kawhoinaw te alokuh,</para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />tuh-e paw tuh nizy awsi kha mah ka pya cih. <verse number="29" style="v" />Muisaw nynh khriccaawbuu hae kya a hopaw kha nakaring a hoipaw ccungccaw tuh thae sah.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Sardis Khriccaawbuu kalan Byataw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />“Sardis khua kya umpaw khriccaawbuu kya-e vaawpaw kalan hynhte zei: Pachia kya-e muisaw ccangsari te awsi ccangsari a hoitupaw nynh hynhte a ho.</para>
  <para style="p">“Na ryalaw hae kha ka ny. Nang tuh na hiin cite min na hoi zemah na chih cipaw ka ny. <verse number="2" style="v" />Ngawrandotua, na chi maw hin na hoi ungpaw thawzung kha lawku tua; pawccecize Pachia malang na ryalaw hae tuh accing cite ka muih khyh. <verse number="3" style="v" />Tukeiccuze ae ccangpyapaw te na thaepaw miakaw kha liathui lah varyng kyngkuh, te ngaesikuh. Tukeiccuze ngawran na do khyh ze, miruh hawte na kalan kae thua cih zah hohtuh ccyh nynh na kya kae thua cih cipaw na nyh lan khyh.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3.3: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 24:43-44">Mat 24.43-44</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 12:39-40">Luk 12.39-40</ref>; <ref loc="REV 16:15">Bya 16.15</ref></char></note> <verse number="4" style="v" />Sardis khua kya mih boeining athu leipaw ccungccaw hae ccapyh na hoi hae; minmin tuh angaekuhpaw athua hae keiccuze boeining rawpaw lawkute kamaw ryte a cceihbua cih hae. <verse number="5" style="v" />A taetupaw tuh boeining rawpaw kha lawsahku athua cih, hiinnaw ccauh kyate a min kha ka thee vae lan khyh, ka Paaw malang te a vaawccungccaw hae malang a min kha ccaekia ka khan cih.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3.5: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 32:32-33">Exo 32.32-33</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 69:28">Sam 69.28</ref>; <ref loc="REV 20:12">Bya 20.12</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 10:32">Mat 10.32</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 12:8">Luk 12.8</ref></char></note> <verse number="6" style="v" />Muisaw nynh khriccaawbuu hae kalan a hopaw kha nakaring a hoipaw ccungccaw tuh thae sah.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="s1">Filadelfia Khriccaawbuu kalan Byataw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />“Filadelfia khua kya umpaw khriccaawbuu kya-e vaawpaw kalan hynhte zei:</para>
  <para style="q1">Athyaapaw, ahmepaw,</para>
  <para style="q2">David kya-e toh a hoitupaw,</para>
  <para style="q1">hum nynh san a khaw kho lei lan</para>
  <para style="q2">a hungtupaw, te hum nynh san</para>
  <para style="q1">a hung kho lei lan</para>
  <para style="q2">a khawtupaw nynh hynhte a ho:<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3.7: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 22:22">Isa 22.22</ref>; <ref loc="JOB 12:14">Job 12.14</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />“Na ryalaw hae kha ka ny. Dotua, hum nynh san a khaw kho leipaw thuakaw ahungkuhpaw kha na malang ka nung vae. Pawccecize nang tuh thawzung ccapyh nynh na hoi cipaw ka ny, ka bya kha na ccykekuh zah ka min kha na vua khyh. <verse number="9" style="v" />Dotua, Judah hae nynh kae thua cite ho hae zah athua lei hae paw mihyn hae kha Satan ccungccaw hae lang ka rae cih hae. Dotua, na cculeihpaw kya bakhung sah khylan te nang kha kae sungsah cipaw nysah khylan minmin kha na kalan kae thuasah cih hae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3.9: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 49:23">Isa 49.23</ref>, <ref loc="ISA 60:14">60.14</ref>, <ref loc="ISA 43:4">43.4</ref></char></note> <verse number="10" style="v" />Ngaesangnaw te asekuhpaw ka bya kha na ccykeku keiccuze laephi vawlan a um hae paw kha syntawtua khylan, laephi pynpi kya yn thua vae cih paw tuhounaw ccyh kyate nang kha kae khynsah cih. <verse number="11" style="v" />Kae tuh arangte kae thua vae cih. Hum nynh sanmah na bawilukhung kha ae luade khyh nawlan, na hoi vae paw kha varyng kyngkuh. <verse number="12" style="v" />A taetupaw kha ka Pachia beikinn kya tungpi lang ka rae cih, aning tuh atolang kharouh pou vae lan khyh. ka Pachia min te ka Pachia khuapi min kha a tungvaw khe ka zei cih; tuh-e khuapi tuh ka Pachia kyate vaawlang te yn rungbungpaw, Jerusalem thawpaw nynh thua; ka min thawpaw kha mah a tungvaw khe ka zei cih.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3.12: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 21:2">Bya 21.2</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 62:2">Isa 62.2</ref>, <ref loc="ISA 65:15">65.15</ref></char></note> <verse number="13" style="v" />Muisaw nynh khriccaawbuu hae kalan a hopaw kha nakaring a hoipaw ccungccaw tuh thae sah.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="s1">Laodisia Khriccaawbuu kalan Byataw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />“Laodisia khua kya umpaw khriccaawbuu kya-e vaawpaw kalan hynhte zei: Pachia kya-e raenaw athonaw athuapaw, a lungzipaw te ahmepaw ccaekia athuapaw Amen nynh hynhte a ho.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3.14: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PRO 8:22">Ptb 8.22</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />“Na ryalaw hae kha ka ny. Nang tuh kyaa mah na kyaa khyh, so mah na so khyh. Nang tuh na kyaa ze kyaa, na so ze so ci ka ry. <verse number="16" style="v" />Tuhcite nang tuh kyaa mah kyaa lei, so mah so lei, lalungpaw na thua keiccuze ka khalang kyate kae thoi vae cih. <verse number="17" style="v" />Nang nynh, ‘Kae tuh ka hoirum, ka dunghoy zah pawsang mah ka hobounaw um vae khyh,’ na ci keiccuze nang tuh myarya a riathaepaw, thawcci lan umpaw, a ryachipaw, a mitmohpaw te ccakaete a umpaw na thuapaw kha na nyhkuh khyh. <verse number="18" style="v" />Tukeiccuze nang kha hynhte tuanaw kae pya: nang tuh na hoirum ccaw, maee kya thyaasah vae paw sui kha kamaw kya-e rekuh, na ccakaete na umpaw maethyanaw kha a langku khyh nawlan boeining na lawku ccaw, boeining arawpaw kha kamaw kya-e rekuh; te ngaw na muih nawlan na mit kha sii na thuhku ccaw, kamaw kya-e rekuh. <verse number="19" style="v" />Ka sungsahpaw ccungccaw hae kha ka pe hae zah ka thuihei hae, tukeiccuze na lungtho sah lah, ngaesikuh.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3.19: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PRO 3:12">Ptb 3.12</ref>; <ref loc="HEB 12:6">Heb 12.6</ref></char></note> <verse number="20" style="v" />Dotua, kae tuh thuakawzung khe ka thadyn zah ka khua. Ccungccaw lukhakheit nynh ka roi thae zah thuakaw yn hungpya ze, tuh-e paw kalan ka tee cih zah looh kae aekheih cih, aning mah kamaw ryte kae aekheih cih. <verse number="21" style="v" />Kae tuh taetu ka thua zah ka Paaw ryte a bawitungkhung vawlan kae haung hawte, taetu athuapaw tuh ka bawitungkhung vawlan kamaw ryte haungnaw kaw ka pya cih. <verse number="22" style="v" />Muisaw nynh Khriccaawbuu hae kalan a hopaw kha nakaring a hoipaw ccungccaw tuh thae sah,” yn cipya.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Vaawlang kya Pachia Beiknaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Hynh-e koute ka do zah vaawlang kya thuakaw ahungkuhpaw kha ka muih. Masaty ka thaepaw roi tuh mungkae roi hawte bya yn hopahpaw roi nynh thua; tuh-e roi nynh, “Hynhlang yn kaethung lah, hynh-e koute yn cyihkuh lanpaw kha kae muihsah cih,” yn cipya. <verse number="2" style="v" />Vaekheihmawte kae tuh Muisaw kyakhe ka um. Dotua, vaawlang kya bawitungkhung ccangkheit um zah, tuh-e bawitungkhung vawlan ccungccaw lu kheit a haung.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4.2-3: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 1:26-28">Eze 1.26-28</ref>, <ref loc="EZK 10:1">10.1</ref></char></note> <verse number="3" style="v" />Tuh-e a haungpaw tuh jasper lung te sardias lung hawte nynh alang. Bawitungkhung po voilu lan emerald lung te alokuhpaw sawdoih a um. <verse number="4" style="v" />Tuh-e bawitungkhung po voilu lan ccangpaw bawitungkhung hae ccangkuin lae pali a um. Tuh-e bawitungkhung hae vawlan piccan hae lu kuin lae pali tuh boeining rawpaw lawkute a haung hae paw kha ka muih. Minmin tuh mih lu kya sui lukhung a khungkuh hae. <verse number="5" style="v" />Bawitungkhung kyate khozawlaepaw, riakawpaw te roiccaepaw hae a pou; te bawitungkhung malang khe Pachia kya-e muisaw ccangsari athuapaw, maeekhua ccangsari a awkuhpaw a um hae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4.5: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 19:16">Exo 19.16</ref>; <ref loc="REV 8:5">Bya 8.5</ref>, <ref loc="REV 11:19">11.19</ref>, <ref loc="REV 16:18">16.18</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 1:13">Eze 1.13</ref>; <ref loc="REV 1:4">Bya 1.4</ref>; <ref loc="ZEC 4:2">Zek 4.2</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Bawitungkhung malang khe lung-awmatei te alokuhpaw muinsado rili a um. Bawitungkhung angaelung te a pepan khe nulang malang te mit te phe beihpaw ahiinpaw sarangpaw sa pali a um hae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4.6-7: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 1:5-10">Eze 1.5-10</ref>, <ref loc="EZK 10:14">10.14</ref>, <ref loc="EZK 10:22">22</ref></char></note> <verse number="7" style="v" />Masaty ahiinpaw sarangpaw tuh chindeih te lokuh zah, ccangningnaw ahiinpaw sarangpaw tuh vaetuataw te nynh aloku. Ccangthumnaw ahiinpaw sarangpaw tuh ccungccaw hawte mitmae hoi zah, ccangpalinaw ahiinpaw sarangpaw tuh mosipi azoupaw te nynh aloku. <verse number="8" style="v" />Tuh-e ahiinpaw sarangpaw sa pali tuh sake ccangtaruh cci a hoi hae. Atolang te alungkhu lang tuh mit te phe beih hae, minmin nynh,</para>
  <para style="q1">“Athyaa, athyaa, athyaa,</para>
  <para style="q2">Athung huaccepaw Bawipaw Pachia,</para>
  <para style="q1">atu lya a umpaw, langmawlya</para>
  <para style="q2">a la um vae paw te malang zemah</para>
  <para style="q1">a um cih paw nynh thua,”</para>
  <para style="m">cite khuazi khuadae apaekuh lei lan hlaw a sah hae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4.8: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 1:18">Eze 1.18</ref>, <ref loc="EZK 10:12">10.12</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 6:2-3">Isa 6.2-3</ref></char></note> <verse number="9" style="v" />Bawitungkhung vawlan a haungpaw, zungzae te zungzae cia a hiinpaw kalan khe tuh-e ahiinpaw sarangpaw hae nynh phu-enaw te sawtuanaw kha pya hae zah lungtuabya he a ho hae tuh, <verse number="10" style="v" />bawitungkhung vawlan a haungpaw malang khe piccan hae lu kuin lae pali tuh bakhung hae zah zungzae te zungzae cia a hiinpaw kha a beik hae, te bawitungkhung malang khe mih bawilukhung hae kha nungsya hae zah,</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />“Pou Bawipaw, nang tuh phu-enaw,</para>
  <para style="q2">sawtuanaw te huhan kha</para>
  <para style="q1">mue lan na ngaekuh;</para>
  <para style="q2">pawccecize pawpaw balyn kha</para>
  <para style="q1">na rae vae, tuh-e hae tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">na rynaw hawte rae thua zah a um hae,”</para>
  <para style="m">a ci hae.</para>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Ccakue te Tuutaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Alungkhu lang te anulang ccawzeikuh zah tazeih ccangsari te khia athuapaw ccakue ccangkheit kha bawitungkhung vawlan a haungpaw a ranglang kuih kyakhe ka muih.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5.1: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 2:9-10">Eze 2.9-10</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 29:11">Isa 29.11</ref></char></note> <verse number="2" style="v" />A thawsaepaw vaawpaw nynh, “Tuh-e ccakue kha daw lan te tazeih hae kha ro lan hummou a ngaekuh?” cite thawte khua-opaw kha ka muih. <verse number="3" style="v" />Tuh-e ccakue a daw kho lanpaw te a do kho lanpaw tuh vaawlang kya thuasah, laephi vaw thuasah, lae kaw lang thuasah hum sanmah um khyh. <verse number="4" style="v" />Tuh-e ccakue tuh daw lan, ria lan te do lan angaekuhpaw hum sanmah muih lan a um khyh keiccuze thawte ka rah.</para>
  <para style="s1">Khri nynh Ccakue A Daw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Piccan hae kyaze lukheitpaw nynh, “Rah nan, dotua, Judah phin kya-e Chindeih, David Tharui nynh a tae vae, ccakue kha daw kho zah tuin kya-e tazeih ccangsari kha a ro kho vae,” cite kae kha yn hopya.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5.5: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 49:9">Gen 49.9</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 11:1">Isa 11.1</ref>, <ref loc="ISA 11:10">10</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Kae nynh ka do zah bawitungkhung te ahiinpaw sarangpaw hae sa pali angaelung kya te piccan hae angaelung kyakhe a chia vae hae paw hawte athuapaw Tuutaw a thadynpaw kha ka muih; tuh-e Tuutaw tuh ki kisari te mit ccangsari hoi zah, tuh-e hae tuh laephi pynpi kalan sawpaw Pachia kya-e muisaw ccangsari nynh thua.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5.6: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 53:7">Isa 53.7</ref>; <ref loc="ZEC 4:10">Zek 4.10</ref></char></note> <verse number="7" style="v" />Tuutaw nynh cceih zah bawitungkhung vawlan a haungpaw a ranglang kuih kya-e ccakue kha a law. <verse number="8" style="v" />Tuhte ccakue kha he a lah tuh, ahiinpaw sarangpaw hae sa pali te piccan hae lu kuin lae pali nynh tintang kha thuasah, mithyaa hae sawsangnaw athuapaw mynkhuhpaw te phe beihpaw sui pakekhupaw hae kha thuasah ccarou ccyngkuh hae zah Tuutaw malang khe a bakhung hae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5.8: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 141:2">Sam 141.2</ref></char></note> <verse number="9" style="v" />Minmin nynh hlaw thawpaw kha sah hae zah,</para>
  <para style="q1">“Nang tuh ccakue kha law lan te</para>
  <para style="q1">ccakue kya-e tazeih hae kha</para>
  <para style="q2">kia lan na ngaekuh,</para>
  <para style="q1">pawccecize nang tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">chia na thua zah na chiise liate</para>
  <para style="q1">phin miakaw, bya miakaw,</para>
  <para style="q2">minphuin miakaw te</para>
  <para style="q1">ram miakaw kya-e ccungccaw hae kha</para>
  <para style="q2">Pachia hanlan na shawkhaw hae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5.9: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 33:3">Sam 33.3</ref>, <ref loc="PSA 98:1">98.1</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 42:10">Isa 42.10</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Minmin kha kae Pachia hanlan</para>
  <para style="q2">siapharan lang te ranpibawi lang</para>
  <para style="q1">na rae hae zah, minmin nynh</para>
  <para style="q2">laephi hynh a uk cih hae,” a ci hae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5.10: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 19:6">Exo 19.6</ref>; <ref loc="REV 1:6">Bya 1.6</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ka do zah bawitungkhung, ahiinpaw sarangpaw hae te piccan hae pepan khe vaaw hae patae roi kha ka thae, tuh-e vaaw hae tuh riatae lei, athong-asan acih hae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5.11: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 7:10">Dan 7.10</ref></char></note> <verse number="12" style="v" />Minmin nynh,</para>
  <para style="q1">“Chia athua vae paw Tuutaw tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">thungnaw, hoirumnaw, hawnaw,</para>
  <para style="q1">thawzung, sawtuanaw, phu-enaw te</para>
  <para style="q2">hythuanaw kha ccou lan a ngaekuh,”</para>
  <para style="m">cite roi accae lante a ho hae. <verse number="13" style="v" />Vaawlang, laephi vawlan, laephi kaw, rili te pawpaw kya balyn a um hae paw ahysuepaw miakaw nynh,</para>
  <para style="q1">“Hythuanaw, sawtuanaw,</para>
  <para style="q2">phu-enaw te thungnaw tuh</para>
  <para style="q1">bawitungkhung vawlan</para>
  <para style="q2">a haungpaw kya te Tuutaw kya</para>
  <para style="q1">zungzae te zungzae cia um sah!”</para>
  <para style="m">a ci hae paw kha ka thae. <verse number="14" style="v" />Ahiinpaw sarangpaw hae sa pali nynh, “Amen!” a ci hae. Piccan hae lu kuin lae pali nynh bakhung hae zah a beik hae.</para>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Tazeih Ccangsari</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tuutaw nynh tazeih ccangsari kya-e ccangkheit a kiapaw kha ka muih, ahiinpaw sarangpaw hae sa pali kyaze sa kheit nynh riakawpaw roi hawte, “Rang lah yn do,” a cipaw kha ka thae. <verse number="2" style="v" />Ka do zah marang arawpaw sa kheit kha ka muih, tuh-e marang tungvaw a ccikuhpaw nynh li kha a ccyngku; amaw kha bawilukhung a pya hae, aning tuh rhaw a tae lalia lante rhaw tae lan po a cceih.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6.2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ZEC 1:8">Zek 1.8</ref>, <ref loc="ZEC 6:3">6.3</ref>, <ref loc="ZEC 6:6">6</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tuutaw nynh ccangningnaw tazeih kha he a kia tuh, ccangningnaw ahiinpaw sarangpaw nynh, “Yn cceih!” a cipaw kha ka thae. <verse number="4" style="v" />Ccangpaw marang sekakingpaw po yn pou; tuh-e marang tungvaw a ccikuhpaw tuh ccungccaw hae nynh lu kheit te lu kheit a chiaku ccaw hae cite laephi kyate daenaw kha lawnaw kaw a hoi, tuh-e paw tuh thaloi pipi kha pya athua.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6.4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ZEC 1:8">Zek 1.8</ref>, <ref loc="ZEC 6:2">6.2</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ccangthumnaw tazeih kha he a kia tuh, ccangthumnaw ahiinpaw sarangpaw nynh, “Yn cceih!” a cipaw kha ka thae. Ka do zah marang amanpaw sa kheit kha ka muih, tuh-e marang tungvaw a ccikuhpaw nynh a kuih kya zawccu kha a ccyngku.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6.5: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ZEC 6:2">Zek 6.2</ref>, <ref loc="ZEC 6:6">6</ref></char></note> <verse number="6" style="v" />Ahysuepaw sa pali angaelung kyate yn ccaepaw roi alopaw nynh, “Chanvuih kilo ccangkheit ze denari kia kheit, barli kilo ccangthum ze denari kia kheit nynh thua; chitui te misutui kha rosah nan,” a cipaw roi kha ka thae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ccangpalinaw tazeih kha he a kia tuh, ccangpalinaw ahiinpaw sarangpaw nynh, “Yn cceih!” a cipaw roi kha ka thae. <verse number="8" style="v" />Ka do zah marang puakakaepaw sa kheit ka muih, tuh-e marang a ccikuhpaw a min tuh Chinaw cikuh zah Hell nynh a nulang te a zui. Minmin tuh laephi pum pali pum kheit kha uknaw kaw hoi hae zah, thaloi te thuasah, ccakannaw te thuasah, chinaw te thuasah, laephi kya-e sarepaw hae te thuasah ccungccaw hae kha chianaw kaw a hoi hae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6.8: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 14:21">Eze 14.21</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ccangpangawnaw tazeih kha he a kia tuh, Pachia bya keiccu thuasah, ccaekia a khan hae keiccu thuasah a chia hae paw mih muisaw hae kha silawhang kaw khe ka muih; <verse number="10" style="v" />minmin nynh, “Athyaapaw te ahmepaw, pou Bawipaw, laephi vawlan a um hae paw hynh kaening chiise mee lang hohseciamou byapia leite, liaru leite na um cih?” cite thawte a sia hae. <verse number="11" style="v" />Minmin lu raveih tuh arawpaw angkiccua kha pya athua hae, mimaw hawte chia athuabua cih hae paw, mimaw ryte ryalahkheih hae paw te mih uno hae kha milu accing makhia sosoh haeung lan a hopya hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ccangtaruhnaw tazeih kha he a kia tuh, ka do zah myarya rupaw innrysuekuhpaw a um; khuanin tuh saming te kuakuhpaw buriboei hawte man zah, sawpaw tuh chii hawte ase.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6.12: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 11:13">Bya 11.13</ref>, <ref loc="REV 16:18">16.18</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 13:10">Isa 13.10</ref>; <ref loc="JOL 2:10">Joe 2.10</ref>, <ref loc="JOL 2:31">31</ref>, <ref loc="JOL 3:15">3.15</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 24:29">Mat 24.29</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 13:24-25">Mar 13.24-25</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:25">Luk 21.25</ref></char></note> <verse number="13" style="v" />Khisan arupaw nynh thaeku ku kha he a mung vae ze, accyh zaw leite thaeku thae a khuaku hawte vaawlang e awsi hae tuh laephi vawlan a ccah hae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6.13-14: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 34:4">Isa 34.4</ref></char></note> <verse number="14" style="v" />Vaawlui tuh ccakue kue hawte a zo; mua miakaw te tuikoih miakaw tuh mih umnaw kyate a nuekuh hae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6.14: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 16:20">Bya 16.20</ref></char></note> <verse number="15" style="v" />Tetuh laephi siapharan hae, a minthaanpaw ccungccaw hae, a hoirumpaw ccungccaw hae, rhawbawi hae, alesaepaw ccungccaw hae, see hae te aluepaw ccungccaw hae balyn tuh laekarung hae te mua e lungpi hae kyakhe a rekuh hae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6.15: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 2:19">Isa 2.19</ref>, <ref loc="ISA 2:21">21</ref></char></note> <verse number="16" style="v" />Minmin nynh mua hae te lungpi hae kha, “Kaening hynh oun tingthin oh lah, bawitungkhung vawlan a haungpaw a mae te Tuutaw thinrianaw kyate oun khaw oh.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6.16: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HOS 10:8">Hos 10.8</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:30">Luk 23.30</ref></char></note> <verse number="17" style="v" />Pawccecize mih thinrianaw nin pi tuh yn thua vae zah, hum nynh mou a ing kho cih?” a cipya hae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6.17: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOL 2:11">Joe 2.11</ref>; <ref loc="MAL 3:2">Mal 3.2</ref></char></note></para>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Israel hae 144,000 Tazeihkhia Thua hae</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tukoute laephi ki kipali kya a thadyn hae paw vaaw hae lu pali nynh laephi vawlan, rili vawlan te thingku hae kha khisan nynh mung nan sah cite laephi san pali kya-e khisan hae phang a kyng hae paw kha ka muih.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7.1: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 49:36">Jer 49.36</ref>; <ref loc="DAN 7:2">Dan 7.2</ref>; <ref loc="ZEC 6:5">Zek 6.5</ref></char></note> <verse number="2" style="v" />Ahiinpaw Pachia kya-e tazeih a hoipaw, nithua langte yn kaethungpaw, ccangpaw vaawpaw kha ka muih; tuh-e paw nynh laephi te rili kha vawsaw pya khylan kaw a mue hae paw vaaw hae lu pali kalan khe thawte sia zah, <verse number="3" style="v" />“Ah Pachia see hae kha mih terui kya tazeih ah khia mawlaezung oh, laephi thuasah, rili thuasah, thingku hae thuasah vawsaw pya nan oh,” a cipya hae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7.3: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 9:4">Eze 9.4</ref>, <ref loc="EZK 9:6">6</ref></char></note> <verse number="4" style="v" />Tukoute tazeihkhia athua hae paw milu ccazing kha ka thae; Israel ccungccaw hae kya-e phin balyn kyate thong za kheit sung pali thong pali kha tazeihkhia athua hae.</para>
  <para style="li">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Judah phin kyate thong haw lae ning kha tazeihkhia athua hae,</para>
  <para style="li">Reuben phin kyate thong haw lae ning,</para>
  <para style="li">Gad phin kyate thong haw lae ning,</para>
  <para style="li">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Asher phin kyate thong haw lae ning,</para>
  <para style="li">Naftali phin kyate thong haw lae ning,</para>
  <para style="li">Manasseh phin kyate thong haw lae ning,</para>
  <para style="li">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Simeon phin kyate thong haw lae ning,</para>
  <para style="li">Levi phin kyate thong haw lae ning,</para>
  <para style="li">Issakhar phin kyate thong haw lae ning,</para>
  <para style="li">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Zebulun phin kyate thong haw lae ning,</para>
  <para style="li">Josef phin kyate thong haw lae ning,</para>
  <para style="li">Benjamin phin kyate thong haw lae ning</para>
  <para style="m">kha tazeihkhia athua hae.</para>
  <para style="s1">Ram Takyh kyate Ccungccaw Patae</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tukoute ka do zah ram takyh, phin takyh, minphuin takyh te bya takyh a ho hae paw kyate riatae leipaw ccungccaw zapi pi tuh bawitungkhung malang te Tuutaw malang khe a thadyn hae; minmin tuh arawpaw angkiccua kha lawkuh hae zah mih kuih kya sarutah ange hae kha ccyng biate,</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />“Khumnaw tuh bawitungkhung vawlan</para>
  <para style="q2">a haungpaw ah Pachia te</para>
  <para style="q1">Tuutaw kya nynh a um,”</para>
  <para style="m">cite roi accae lante thawte a sia hae. <verse number="11" style="v" />Bawitungkhung pepan, piccan hae te ahiinpaw sarangpaw sa pali pepan khe vaaw hae balyn tuh a thadyn hae, bawitungkhung malang khe bakhung hae zah Pachia kha a beik hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />“Amen! Hythuanaw, phu-enaw,</para>
  <para style="q2">hawnaw, lungtuabya honaw,</para>
  <para style="q1">sawtuanaw, thungnaw te</para>
  <para style="q2">thawsaenaw tuh ah Pachia kya</para>
  <para style="q1">zungzae te zungzae cia um sah!</para>
  <para style="q2">Amen,” a ci hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Piccan hae kyaze lukheitpaw nynh tho zah, “Arawpaw angkiccua a lawkuh hae paw hynh-e hae hynh hum hae mou? Teitemou oun thua hae?” cite kae kha yn khia. <verse number="14" style="v" />Kae nynh, “Bawipaw, nang nynh na nyh,” ka cipya. Aning nynh kae kha, “Hynh-e hae tuh myarya lepaw vawsawrunaw kyate oun pou hae paw nynh thua hae; minmin nynh mih angkiccua kha Tuutaw chii kya sukuh hae zah a rawsahku hae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7.14: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 12:1">Dan 12.1</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 24:21">Mat 24.21</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 13:19">Mar 13.19</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tukeiccuze minmin tuh</para>
  <para style="q1">Pachia kya-e bawitungkhung malang khe</para>
  <para style="q2">um hae zah a beikinn kyakhe</para>
  <para style="q1">khuazi khuadae rya a lawpya hae;</para>
  <para style="q2">te bawitungkhung vawlan</para>
  <para style="q1">a haungpaw tuh minmin laku khe a um cih.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Minmin tuh mih vuelaw</para>
  <para style="q2">boi vae lan khyh, mih tui mah</para>
  <para style="q1">haw boi vae lan khyh;</para>
  <para style="q2">khuanin nynh e vae lan khyh hae,</para>
  <para style="q2">maeeso nynh mah u vae lan khyh hae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7.16: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 49:10">Isa 49.10</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Pawccecize bawitungkhung</para>
  <para style="q2">angaelung kya a umpaw</para>
  <para style="q1">Tuutaw nynh minmin kha</para>
  <para style="q2">a rin cih hae zah, hiinnaw tuidy kalan</para>
  <para style="q1">a cciakhae cih hae,</para>
  <para style="q2">te Pachia nynh mih mit kya-e</para>
  <para style="q1">mitphi balyn kha a hupah cih hae,”</para>
  <para style="m">yn cipya.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7.17: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 23:1">Sam 23.1</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 34:23">Eze 34.23</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 23:2">Sam 23.2</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 49:10">Isa 49.10</ref>, <ref loc="ISA 25:8">25.8</ref></char></note></para>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Ccangsarinaw Tazeih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tuutaw nynh ccangsarinaw tazeih kha he a kia tuh, vaawlang kya suimilan akhoi loukaw daetedae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Pachia malang a thadyn hae paw vaaw hae lu sari kha ka muih, te minmin kha mungkae ccangsari a pya hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ccangpaw vaawpaw nynh yn thua zah sui pakephepaw kha ccyngkute silawhang pe khe a thadyn; bawitungkhung malang a umpaw sui silawhang vawlan khe mithyaa hae balyn kya-e sawsangnaw ryte thuakhae khylan maee te upaw mynkhuhpaw patae kha tuh-e paw tuh a pya hae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8.3: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="AMO 9:1">Amo 9.1</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 30:1">Exo 30.1</ref>, <ref loc="EXO 30:3">3</ref></char></note> <verse number="4" style="v" />Maee te upaw mynkhuhpaw a maeekhuh tuh mithyaa hae kya-e sawsangnaw ryte vaawpaw kuih kyate Pachia malang a kaethung. <verse number="5" style="v" />Tukoute vaawpaw nynh pakephepaw kha lah zah, tuh-e tuh silawhang kya-e maee khate phe a biasah koute laephi vawlan dae a vua; tetuh kholung yn thyh, roi yn ccae, khozaw yn laekuh zah innry yn suekuh.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8.5: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 16:12">Lev 16.12</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 10:2">Eze 10.2</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 19:16">Exo 19.16</ref>; <ref loc="REV 11:19">Bya 11.19</ref>, <ref loc="REV 16:18">16.18</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="s1">Mungkae Ccangsari</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Mungkae ccangsari a hoi hae paw vaaw hae lu sari tuh mungkae tu lan paccynkute a um hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Lu kheitnaw vaawpaw nynh mungkae he a tu tuh, chii ryte apykuhpaw hya te maee palou yn um zah, tuh-e hae tuh laephi vawlan a ccah hae; laephi pum thum pum kheit kha a u, thingku hae pum thum pum kheit te lonua ahinpaw balyn kha marya a u.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8.7: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 9:23-25">Exo 9.23-25</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 38:22">Eze 38.22</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Lu ningnaw vaawpaw nynh mungkae tu zah, maee nynh a upaw, myarya lepaw mua alopaw tuh rili lungkhu lang ccaring vua athua; te rili pum thum pum kheit tuh chiise lang a tang. <verse number="9" style="v" />Rili kya umpaw ahiinpaw sarangpaw pum thum pum kheit tuh a chih hae; sanphalung hae pum thum pum kheit tuh aroh.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Lu thumnaw vaawpaw nynh a mungkae kha he a tu tuh, maeekhua hawte aruapaw awsipi tuh vaawlang te ccah zah, vawpi hae pum thum pum kheit vawlan te tuidy hae vawlan khe a ccah.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8.10: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 14:12">Isa 14.12</ref></char></note> <verse number="11" style="v" />Tuh-e awsi min tuh Eccangkary acikuh. Tui hae pum thum pum kheit tuh eccangkary lang a tang; tui tuh akhahpaw lang rae athua keiccu tui keiccuze ccungccaw patae a chih hae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8.11: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 9:15">Jer 9.15</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Lu palinaw vaawpaw nynh mungkae tu zah khuanin pum thum pum kheit, sawpaw pum thum pum kheit te awsi hae pum thum pum kheit tuh ro athua keiccuze tuh-e hae pum thum pum kheit tuh pong amoh; khuadae pum thum pum kheit tuh aw khyh; khuazi pum thum pum kheit mah tuhawte nynh thua.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8.12: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 13:10">Isa 13.10</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 32:7">Eze 32.7</ref>; <ref loc="JOL 2:10">Joe 2.10</ref>, <ref loc="JOL 2:31">31</ref>, <ref loc="JOL 3:15">3.15</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ka do zah vaawlang angaelung kya azoupaw mosipi sa kheit nynh, “Vaawccungccaw hae lu thum nynh oun tu vae cih hae paw ccangpaw mungkae roi keiccuze laephi vaw um hae paw hanlan ngaethya lan kou um, ngaethya lan kou um, ngaethya lan kou um!” cite thawte a siapaw roi kha ka thae.</para>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Lu pangawnaw vaawpaw nynh mungkae tu zah, awsi ccangkheit tuh vaawlang te laephi vawlan a ccawpaw kha ka muih. Adianaw um lei lan akhupaw laekarung toh kha tuh-e paw tuh a pya hae. <verse number="2" style="v" />Aning nynh adianaw um lei lan akhupaw laekarung kha he a hung tuh, myarya lepaw maeephupi kya-e maeekhuh hawte laekarung lungkhu te maeekhuh a pouthung; laekarung kya-e maeekhuh keiccuze khuanin te vaawlui tuh pong amoh.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9.2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 19:28">Gen 19.28</ref></char></note> <verse number="3" style="v" />Maeekhuh kyate tungkhipaw hae tuh laephi vawlan oun pou hae, laephi kya-e zekang hae nynh a hoi hae paw thungnaw te alokuhpaw thungnaw kha minmin tuh pya athua hae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9.3: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 10:12-15">Exo 10.12-15</ref></char></note> <verse number="4" style="v" />Laephi kya-e lonua, ahinpaw aku te thingku ku kheit sanmah vawsawnaw pya leite, mih terui kya Pachia kya-e tazeih a hoi leipaw ccungccaw hae kyalya kha vawsaw a pya nawlan hae minmin kha kawpya athua hae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9.4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 9:4">Eze 9.4</ref></char></note> <verse number="5" style="v" />Minmin nynh tazeihkhia athua leipaw ccungccaw hae kha chianaw kaw hoi khyh hae, thuasalama sawpaw sah pangaw cia vawsaw pyanaw kaw tuh ua athua hae. Minmin nynh vawsawnaw pya hae zah accipaw tuh zekang nynh ccungccaw a teih vae ze accipaw te nynh aloku. <verse number="6" style="v" />Tuin ccyh kya ccungccaw hae nynh chinaw kha a ccungkuh cih hae zah muihkuh lan khyh hae; chi a ry hae zemah chinaw nynh a ccuetaw cih hae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9.6: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 3:21">Job 3.21</ref>; <ref loc="JER 8:3">Jer 8.3</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tuh-e tungkhipaw hae pungsan tuh rhawtuk lan a paccyn hae paw marang hae te nynh aloku; mih lu kya sui te raepaw bawilukhung a khungkuh hae paw te lokuh zah, mih maesue tuh ccungccaw maesue te nynh aloku.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9.7: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOL 2:4">Joe 2.4</ref></char></note> <verse number="8" style="v" />Mih sang tuh nopi hae sang te lokuh zah, mih haw tuh chindeih haw te nynh aloku.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9.8: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOL 1:6">Joe 1.6</ref></char></note> <verse number="9" style="v" />Mih kya-e bykhaw tuh sivaw bykhaw te lokuh zah, mih sake a zaw hae paw roi tuh rhawtuk lan a ccue hae paw marangle hae patae roi te nynh aloku.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9.9: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOL 2:5">Joe 2.5</ref></char></note> <verse number="10" style="v" />Zekang hawte leihmae hoi hae zah, mih leihmae kya hinpaw a um, tuh-e mih leihmae kyatuin sawpaw sah pangaw cia ccungccaw hae vawsaw pyanawpaw thungnaw a hoi hae. <verse number="11" style="v" />Minmin nynh siapharan lu kheit hoi hae zah, tuh-e paw tuh adianaw um lei lan akhupaw laekarung kya-e vaawpaw nynh thua. A min tuh Hebru bya te Abaddon cikuh zah Grik bya te Apollyon acikuh.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ngaethya lan umpaw ccangkheit tuh athang vae; dotua, hynh-e koute ngaethya lan umpaw ccangning yn thua ung cih.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Lu taruhnaw vaawpaw nynh mungkae tu zah, Pachia malang umpaw sui silawhang kya-e ki kipali kyate roi roikheit ka thae;<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9.13: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 30:1-3">Exo 30.1-3</ref></char></note> <verse number="14" style="v" />tuh-e roi nynh mungkae a hoitupaw lu taruhnaw e vaawpaw kha, “Myarya lepaw Zufrates vawpi kya a khii hae paw vaaw hae lu pali kha supah hae,” a cipya. <verse number="15" style="v" />Ccungccaw hae pum thum pum kheit kha chia khylan tuh-e suimilan, tuh-e nin, tuh-e sawpaw, tuh-e kum hanlan a paccyn hae paw vaaw hae lu pali kha a supya hae. <verse number="16" style="v" />Marang a ccikuh hae paw rhawkaw phu milu tuh million za ning acih; minmin milu ccazing kha ka thae. <verse number="17" style="v" />Ka vizin kya marang hae kha hynhte ka muih: tuh-e marang hae tungvaw a ccikuh hae paw tuh maee hawte asepaw, ke hawte amepaw, safaia lung hawte ahinpaw bykhaw hae kha a hoi hae; marang hae lu tuh chindeih lu te nynh aloku hae, te mih khalang lungkhu te maee, maeekhuh te kemaee apou. <verse number="18" style="v" />Mih khalang lungkhu te apoupaw maee, maeekhuh te kemaee, hynh-e phuin thum keiccuze ccungccaw hae pum thum pum kheit tuh a chih hae. <verse number="19" style="v" />Marang hae mih thungnaw tuh mih khalang te mih leihmae kya nynh a um; mih leihmae tuh hupaw hawte lu hoi zah, tuh-e mih leihmae te ccungccaw hae kha vawsaw a pya hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Hynh-e shethya keiccu chi leite a laehypaw ccungccaw hae tuh raerangsaro hae kha thuasah, ngawmuih kho leipaw, nawthae kho leipaw te a cceih kho leipaw sui, ngun, sohin, lung, thingphe te raepaw zohtuh hae kha thuasah a beik khyh nawlan hae, mih kuih te a raeku hae paw hanlan ngaesikunaw hoi khyh hae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9.20: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 115:4-7">Sam 115.4-7</ref>, <ref loc="PSA 135:15-17">135.15-17</ref>; <ref loc="DAN 5:23">Dan 5.23</ref></char></note> <verse number="21" style="v" />Minmin nynh ccungccaw a chia hae paw, ccungccaw a naaw hae paw, a ohhuakunaw hae paw te a ru hae paw kha ngaesikuh khyh hae.</para>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Vaawpaw te Ccakue Taraw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />A thawsaepaw ccangpaw vaawpaw tuh maeking kha zingkute vaawlang te yn rungbungpaw kha ka muih; a lu vawlan sawdoih a um, a maesue tuh khuanin te lokuh zah, a ccu tuh maee tungpi te nynh aloku. <verse number="2" style="v" />Adawkuhpaw ccakue taraw kha a kuih kya a ccyng; a ranglang ccu kha rili vawlan sy zah a voilang ccu kha laephi vawlan a sy. <verse number="3" style="v" />Chindeih nynh a sia hawte roi accae lante thawte a sia; he a sia koute kholungthyhpaw roi vaesari accae. <verse number="4" style="v" />Kholungthyhpaw roi vaesari accae koute, kae tuh ccaw zei lan ka noukuh vae; vaawlang kyate roi nynh, “Kholungthyhpaw roi vaesari accaepaw uccaw hae kha tazeihkhia lah, tuh-e hae tuh zei nan,” cite kamaw yn hopyapaw kha ka thae. <verse number="5" style="v" />Rili te laephi vawlan a thadynpaw ka muihpaw vaawpaw nynh a kuih kha vaawlang hangthung zah,<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10.5-7: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 20:11">Exo 20.11</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 32:40">Deu 32.40</ref>; <ref loc="DAN 12:7">Dan 12.7</ref>; <ref loc="AMO 3:7">Amo 3.7</ref></char></note> <verse number="6" style="v" />vaawlang te vaawlang kya umpaw uccaw hae, laephi te laephi kya umpaw uccaw hae, rili te rili kya umpaw uccaw hae a raetupaw, zungzae te zungzae cia a hiinpaw min phyate thyalawkuh zah, “Accyh ro vae lan khyh. <verse number="7" style="v" />Pachia nynh a ryalahtu profeh hae kya a la ho vae hawte, lu sarinaw e vaawpaw nynh mungkae a tupaw roi he yn ccae ccyh kyakhe Pachia byakhupaw tuh yn ccing cih,” a ci.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Vaawlang e ka thaepaw roi nynh kamaw kha bua yn hopah zah, “Rili te laephi vawlan a thadynpaw vaawpaw kuih kya adawkuhpaw ccakue taraw khuh ccianua lah yn lah,” yn cipya.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10.8-10: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 2:8-3:3">Eze 2.8—3.3</ref></char></note> <verse number="9" style="v" />Vaawpaw kalan ka cceih zah, “Ccakue taraw kha yn pya,” ka cipya. Aning nynh, “Lawkuh lah ae, na vue kya a khah cih, thuasalama na khalang kya tuh khoitui hawte a e cih,” yn cipya. <verse number="10" style="v" />Vaawpaw kuih kya-e ccakue taraw kha ka lawkuh zah ka ae; ka khalang kya tuh khoitui hawte e zah, ccahe ka ae kou tuh ka vue kya a khah.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Aning nynh, “Ccungccaw hae patae, minphuin hae, bya hae te siapharan hae kalan khe profehbya bua na ho hahe cih,” cite yn hopya.</para>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Ccaekia Lu Ning</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tukoute hoitang alopaw tounawpaw ccungngue ccangkheit kha yn pya zah, “Thokuh lah, Pachia beikinn te silawhang kha la tou, tuin kya a beiktu hae kha mah la ria hae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11.1: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 40:3">Eze 40.3</ref>; <ref loc="ZEC 2:1-2">Zek 2.1-2</ref></char></note> <verse number="2" style="v" />Thuasalama beikinn atolang e voidu kha tuh tou leite la cciataw; pawccecize tuh-e tuh Zenta hae kalan pya athua vae; minmin nynh athyaapaw khualipi kha sawpaw sung pali sah ning cia a syde cih hae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11.2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 21:24">Luk 21.24</ref></char></note> <verse number="3" style="v" />Ka ccaekia lu ning kha thungnaw ka pya cih hae zah, minmin nynh buriboei kha zingkute nin thong kheit za ning sung taruh cia profehbya a ho cih hae,” a ci.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />E ccaekia hae lu ning tuh laephi a peetu Bawipaw malang a thadyn hae paw maeekhuatung ccangning te oliv thingku ku ning nynh thua hae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11.4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ZEC 4:3">Zek 4.3</ref>, <ref loc="ZEC 4:11-14">11-14</ref></char></note> <verse number="5" style="v" />Lukhakheit nynh minmin kha vawsaw pya a ry hae ze, mih khalang lungkhu te maee pou zah mih rhaw hae kha po a laang hae; lukhakheit nynh minmin kha vawsaw pya a ry hae ze, tuh-e paw tuh tuhcite chia athua hahe cih. <verse number="6" style="v" />Tuh-e hae nynh profehbya a ho lya hae khe khuaa araw khyh nawlan, vaawlang thuakaw khaw khonaw kaw a hoi hae; tui kha chii lang tangsah khonaw thungnaw, a ry takyh hae te shethya aphuinphuin te laephi kha vawsaw pya khonaw thungnaw kha a hoi hae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11.6: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 17:1">1Si 17.1</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 7:17-19">Exo 7.17-19</ref>; <ref loc="1SA 4:8">1Sa 4.8</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Minmin nynh ccaekiakhan hae paw kha he a thangsah hae te, adianaw um lei lan akhupaw laekarung lungkhu te yn kaethungpaw sarepaw nynh minmin kha rhaw a tuk cih hae, a tae cih hae zah a theih cih hae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11.7: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 7:7">Dan 7.7</ref>, <ref loc="DAN 7:21">21</ref>; <ref loc="REV 13:5-7">Bya 13.5-7</ref>, <ref loc="REV 17:8">17.8</ref></char></note> <verse number="8" style="v" />Mih rhua hae tuh muisaw lante Sodom te Izip a ci hae paw, myarya lepaw khuapi kya-e laanpi kyakhe a huekuh cih hae; mih Bawipaw kha mah tuin khua kyakhe vaelantung kya a khiade hae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11.8: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 1:9-10">Isa 1.9-10</ref></char></note> <verse number="9" style="v" />Ram hae, phin hae, bya hae te minphuin hae kya-e ccungccaw hae nynh mih rhua hae kha nin thum khoi lungkhu a muih cih hae zah, shaw kya uu lan a kang cih hae, <verse number="10" style="v" />laephi vawlan a um hae paw tuh mih lungtua cih zah mih lungpaw cih, lu kheit te lu kheit lasung a kykuh cih hae; pawccecize langmawlya tuh-e profeh hae lu ning nynh laephi vawlan a um hae paw kha myarya ccih lante vawsawnaw a la pya hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Nin thum khoi acih koute Pachia kyate hiinnawpaw hy tuh mih lungkhu lang tee zah mih ccu te a thadyn hae, minmin kha a muih hae paw tuh myarya a rih hae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11.11: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 37:10">Eze 37.10</ref></char></note> <verse number="12" style="v" />Tuinte vaawlang e myarya ccaepaw roi nynh, “Hynhlang oun kaethung oh!” cite a hopya hae paw kha tuh-e hae lu ning nynh a thae hae. Minmin tuh mih rhaw hae muihnaw kyakhe maeking te vaawlang a kae hae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11.12: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 2:11">2Si 2.11</ref></char></note> <verse number="13" style="v" />Tuh ccyh lyakhe innry thawte suekuh zah khuapi pum haw pum kheit tuh pong ating, tuh-e innrysuekunaw kya ccungccaw thong sari a chih hae, tuhlaepaw ccungccaw hae tuh rih hae zah vaawlang e Pachia kha phu-enaw a pya hae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11.13: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 6:12">Bya 6.12</ref>, <ref loc="REV 16:18">16.18</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ngaethya lan umpaw ccangningnaw tuh athang vae; dotua, hynh-e koute ngaethya lan umpaw ccangthumnaw tuh taloi yn thua cih.</para>
  <para style="s1">Ccangsarinaw Mungkae</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Lu sarinaw vaawpaw nynh a mungkae kha tu zah, vaawlang te myarya accaepaw roi hae nynh,</para>
  <para style="q1">“Laephi peenaw tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">ah Bawipaw peenaw te a Khri kya-e</para>
  <para style="q1">peenaw lang phe tang vae,</para>
  <para style="q2">aning nynh zungzae te</para>
  <para style="q1">zungzae cia a uk vae cih,”</para>
  <para style="m">cite a ho hae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11.15: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 15:18">Exo 15.18</ref>; <ref loc="DAN 2:44">Dan 2.44</ref>, <ref loc="DAN 7:14">7.14</ref>, <ref loc="DAN 7:27">27</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Pachia malang mimaw bawitungkhung vawlan a haung hae paw piccan hae lu kuin lae pali nynh bakhungte Pachia kha beik hae zah,</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />“Atu lya a umpaw, langmawlya mah</para>
  <para style="q2">a la um vae paw, Athung huaccepaw,</para>
  <para style="q1">Bawipaw Pachia, alesaepaw</para>
  <para style="q2">na huhan kha na lawkuh zah</para>
  <para style="q1">na uk vae keiccuze na kalan</para>
  <para style="q2">lungtuabya kae ho.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Minphuin hae tuh myarya mih thinria,</para>
  <para style="q2">thuasalama na bungpawnaw tuh</para>
  <para style="q1">yn thua vae;</para>
  <para style="q2">michi hae byapianaw ccyh tuh</para>
  <para style="q1">yn thua vae,</para>
  <para style="q2">namaw rya ae lawpah hae paw</para>
  <para style="q1">na profeh hae, mithyaa hae,</para>
  <para style="q2">na min raw a rih hae paw</para>
  <para style="q1">ccungccaw adih ale hae kha</para>
  <para style="q2">ryalaw mee pyanaw ccyh te</para>
  <para style="q1">laephi a rohtu hae kha</para>
  <para style="q2">ronaw ccyh tuh yn thua vae,”</para>
  <para style="m">a ci hae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11.18: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 2:5">Sam 2.5</ref>, <ref loc="PSA 110:5">110.5</ref>, <ref loc="PSA 115:13">115.13</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Vaawlang a umpaw Pachia beikinn tuh hungkuh zah, a beikinn kyakhe amaw kya-e byakin thingkua kha muih athua; te khozaw alaekuh, roi accae, kholung athyh, innrysuekuh zah myarya lepaw hya accah.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11.19: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 8:5">Bya 8.5</ref>, <ref loc="REV 16:18">16.18</ref>, <ref loc="REV 16:21">21</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Nopinung te Nakaa-hupi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Vaawlang kya myarya lepaw muihsahnaw a langkuh: Nopinung lu kheit tuh khuanin khate ccaankuh zah sawpaw kha a ccu kaw khe a nung, awsi haw lae ning a umpaw bawilukhung kha a lu vawlan a khungku. <verse number="2" style="v" />Tuh-e nung tuh ccaawpoi zah a ccaaw pui lan acih tuh, neitangia acci keiccuze thawte a siakhaekuh. <verse number="3" style="v" />Vaawlang kya ccangpaw muihsahnaw alangkuh: Dotua oh, alu lu sari te aki ki haw hoi zah, a lu hae vawlan bawilukhung ccangsari a hoipaw, myarya lepaw nakaa-hupi sekakingpaw a um.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12.3: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 7:7">Dan 7.7</ref></char></note> <verse number="4" style="v" />A leihmae nynh vaawlang e awsi hae pum thum pum kheit kha sue hae zah, laephi vawlan a vua hae; nopinung kya-e vyavya pui vae paw ccaaw tuh ccahe yn pui te, po laang lan cite nakaa-hupi tuh nopinung malang khe phang a thadyn.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12.4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 8:10">Dan 8.10</ref></char></note> <verse number="5" style="v" />Tuinte sivaw hoitang te minphuin miakaw a uk cih paw ccapaw kha nopinung nynh a saah; a ccaaw tuh Pachia kalan te a bawitungkhung kalan lawthung athua.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12.5: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 66:7">Isa 66.7</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 2:9">Sam 2.9</ref></char></note> <verse number="6" style="v" />Nopinung tuh nin thong kheit za ning sung taruh cia looh dang athua ccaw cite Pachia nynh a paccynpyapaw hmin, ramkaw langkhe a ccue.</para>
  <para style="s1">Mikhael nynh Nakaa-hupi A Tae</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Te vaawlang kya rhawtukkunaw a um; Mikhael te a vaawccungccaw hae nynh nakaa-hupi kha rhaw a tuk hae, nakaa-hupi te a vaawccungccaw hae nynh rhaw a tukru hae zemah <verse number="8" style="v" />a shung hae keiccuze minmin hanlan vaawlang kya umnaw kharouh um vae khyh. <verse number="9" style="v" />Laephi pynpi a lingpaw, Raerangsaro te Satan a ci hae paw langmawlya e hupaw, myarya lepaw nakaa-hupi tuh laephi kalan vua athua, amaw ryte a vaawccungccaw hae tuh vua athua hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Vaawlang e roi accaepaw nynh,</para>
  <para style="q2">“Khumnaw, huhan,</para>
  <para style="q1">ah Pachia kya-e peenaw te</para>
  <para style="q2">a Khri kya-e kawhoinaw tuh</para>
  <para style="q1">atu yn thua vae;</para>
  <para style="q2">pawccecize ah uno hae kha</para>
  <para style="q1">seibetupaw, ah Pachia malang</para>
  <para style="q2">khuazi khuadae minmin kha</para>
  <para style="q1">seibetupaw tuh sawbung athua vae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ah uno hae nynh</para>
  <para style="q2">Tuutaw chii liate thuasah,</para>
  <para style="q1">mih ccaekia tangnaw bya liate thuasah</para>
  <para style="q2">Satan kha a tae hae; minmin tuh</para>
  <para style="q1">chi ngan ciate mih hiinnaw kha</para>
  <para style="q2">a pyakuh hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tukeiccuze, pou vaawlang te</para>
  <para style="q1">vaawlang a um hae paw,</para>
  <para style="q2">nae lungtua sah!</para>
  <para style="q1">Pou laephi te rili, nanning hanlan</para>
  <para style="q2">ngaethya lan kou um;</para>
  <para style="q1">pawccecize Satan nynh</para>
  <para style="q2">ccyh sosoh rou nynh</para>
  <para style="q1">ka hoi vae cipaw kha a nyku keiccuze</para>
  <para style="q2">myarya a thinria zah</para>
  <para style="q1">nae kalan yn rungbung vae,”</para>
  <para style="m">cite a hopaw kha ka thae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Nakaa-hupi nynh laephi kalan yn vua vae hae cipaw he a nyh tuh, ccapise a saahpaw nopinung kha a dee. <verse number="14" style="v" />Tuh-e nopinung tuh hupaw kyate lue khylan ramkaw lang a zou nawlan myarya lepaw mosipi sake ccangning kha pya athua; nopinung tuh tuin kyakhe ccyh kheit, ccyh hae te ccyh angankuh cia do-oih athua.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12.14: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 7:25">Dan 7.25</ref>, <ref loc="DAN 12:7">12.7</ref></char></note> <verse number="15" style="v" />Tuh-e nopinung tuh tui nynh lou sah cite hupaw nynh a khalang lungkhu te tui kha vawpi hawte nopinung nulang te a pousah. <verse number="16" style="v" />Thuasalama laephi nynh nopinung kha a bawm, laephi nynh a khalang kha aw zah nakaa-hupi nynh a khalang lungkhu te a pousahpaw vawpi kha po a laang.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Nakaa-hupi tuh nopinung elang myarya a thinria zah, nopinung ciihan a laehy hae paw kha rhawtuk khylan po a cceih; tuh-e hae tuh Pachia kawbya a zui hae paw te Jesu Khri kya-e ccaekia a hoi hae paw nynh thua. <verse number="18" style="v" />Hupi tuh rili kin laesia vawlan khe a thadyn.</para>
  <chapter number="13" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Sarepaw Sa Ning</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Rili lungkhu te yn pouthungpaw sarepaw sa kheit kha ka muih; tuh-e sarepaw tuh lu lusari te ki kihaw a hoi; a ki vawlan bawilukhung ccanghaw um zah, a lu hae vawlan Pachia thethyasahpaw min a um.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13.1: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 7:3">Dan 7.3</ref>; <ref loc="REV 17:3">Bya 17.3</ref>, <ref loc="REV 17:7-12">7-12</ref></char></note> <verse number="2" style="v" />Ka muihpaw sarepaw tuh kaesing te nynh aloku; a ccu tuh vong ccu te lokuh zah a khalang tuh chindeih khalang te nynh aloku. Nakaa-hupi nynh a thungnaw, a bawitungkhung te alepaw kawhoinaw kha sarepaw kalan a pya.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13.2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 7:4-6">Dan 7.4-6</ref></char></note> <verse number="3" style="v" />Alu lu kheit tuh chikhaeku khopaw vaemaw a muepaw hawkhate nynh thua; chikhaeku khopaw a vaemaw tuh dansah athua, laephi ccungccaw hae balyn tuh mih ngaeangthua zah sarepaw nulang khe a zuikuh hae. <verse number="4" style="v" />Sarepaw kha kawhoinaw a pyatupaw nakaa-hupi kha minmin nynh a beik hae; sarepaw kha mah beik hae zah, “Sarepaw alopaw hummou a um? Hummou sarepaw kha rhawtuk kho cih?” a ci hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Sarepaw tuh lysakunaw bya te Pachia thethyasahnaw bya a hothyapaw munglae kha pya thua zah, sawpaw sung pali sah ning lungkhu kawhoinaw kha mah pya athua<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13.5-6: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 7:8">Dan 7.8</ref>, <ref loc="DAN 7:25">25</ref>, <ref loc="DAN 11:36">11.36</ref></char></note>. <verse number="6" style="v" />A khalang kha aw zah Pachia thethyasahnaw bya kha a ho, Pachia a min, a umnaw te vaawlang a um hae paw kha thethyasahnaw bya a ho. <verse number="7" style="v" />Mithyaa hae kha rhawtuknaw kaw te taenaw kaw a mue; phin miakaw, minphuin miakaw, bya miakaw te ram miakaw tungvaw kawhoinaw kha amaw kya pya athua.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13.7: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 7:21">Dan 7.21</ref></char></note> <verse number="8" style="v" />Chia athuapaw Tuutaw kya-e hiinnaw ccauh kya laephi athotakaw te mih min zei athua lei hae paw, laephi vawlan a um hae paw balyn nynh sarepaw kha oun beik cih hae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13.8: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 69:28">Sam 69.28</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Nakaring a hoipaw ccungccaw tuh thae sah:</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ming hae kha seetangnaw kalan</para>
  <para style="q2">a cciakhae hae paw ccungccaw tuh</para>
  <para style="q1">amaw mah seetangnaw kalan</para>
  <para style="q2">a cceih cih; thaloi te</para>
  <para style="q1">ccungccaw a theihpaw tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">amaw mah thaloi te</para>
  <para style="q1">chia athua hahe cih.</para>
  <para style="m">E kyahin mithyaa hae zynnaw te lungsaenaw tuh a um.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13.10: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 15:2">Jer 15.2</ref>, <ref loc="JER 43:11">43.11</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="s1">Sarepaw Sa Ningnaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Laephi lungkhu te yn poupaw ccangpaw sarepaw kha ka muih; aning tuh tuutaw hawte ki kining hoi zah nakaa-hupi hawte bya a ho. <verse number="12" style="v" />Tuh-e sarepaw nynh masaty sarepaw kya-e thungnaw balyn kha amaw a muihnaw kya mawkhe pong a mang; aning nynh laephi te laephi kya um hae paw kha chikhaeku khopaw vaemaw kyate a dan vae paw masaty sarepaw kha a beiksah hae. <verse number="13" style="v" />Aning nynh myarya lepaw muihsahnaw kha langsakuh zah, ccungccaw hae muihnaw kyakhe maee kha vaawlang te laephi vawlan a ccawsah. <verse number="14" style="v" />Aning nynh masaty e sarepaw malang langsakunaw kaw a muepaw muihsahnaw hae liate laephi vawlan a um hae paw kha a ling hae. Thaloi te vaemaw a mue zemah a hiin ungpaw sarepaw azuh kha raeku lan laephi vawlan a um hae paw kha a hopya hae. <verse number="15" style="v" />Sarepaw azuh nynh bya a ho kho nawlan thuasah, sarepaw azuh a beik leipaw miakaw tuh chia athua nawlan thuasah, sarepaw azuh tuh hiinnaw pya khonaw kaw kha aning tuh pya athua. <verse number="16" style="v" />Aning nynh ccungccaw balyn kha, adihpaw mah alepaw mah, a hoirumpaw mah a ryachipaw mah, a luepaw mah see mah mih ranglang kuih kya khyhze mih terui kyakhe syntawnaw tazeih a khiasaku hae. <verse number="17" style="v" />Sarepaw min khyhze a min namba athuapaw syntawnaw tazeih a um khyh lanze, humhung mah re khonaw te zua khonaw kaw hoi khyh. <verse number="18" style="v" />Hynh-e kya hawnaw a um: thaethyanaw a hoipaw ccungccaw nynh sarepaw namba kha ria sah; pawccecize tuh-e tuh ccungccaw namba thua zah, tuh-e namba tuh 666 nynh thua.</para>
  <chapter number="14" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Tuutaw te A Ccungccaw hae 144,000</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Kae do zah, Tuutaw tuh Zion Mua vawlan a thadyn, mih terui kya amaw min te a Paaw min azeikuhpaw 144,000 tuh amaw ryte a umkheih hae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14.1: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 9:4">Eze 9.4</ref>; <ref loc="REV 7:3">Bya 7.3</ref></char></note> <verse number="2" style="v" />Tuiphue atoikuhpaw patae roi hawte thuasah, myarya accaepaw kholungthyhpaw roi hawte thuasah vaawlang e roi kha ka thae; tintang a khua hae paw nynh mih tintang a khua hae paw roi hawte accaepaw roi kha mah ka thae. <verse number="3" style="v" />Bawitungkhung malang thuasah, ahiinpaw sarangpaw sa pali te piccan hae malang thuasah hlaw thawpaw kha minmin nynh a sah hae. Tuh-e hlaw tuh laephi kyate shawkhaw athua hae paw 144,000 laelan hum nynh sanmah ccangkuh kho khyh hae. <verse number="4" style="v" />Minmin tuh ccangvady thua hae zah, nopi hae ryte a nungsikuh lei hae paw nynh thua; minmin tuh Tuutaw a ccianaw miakaw lang a zui hae paw nynh thua; ccungccaw hae laku kyate shawkhaw thua hae zah, Pachia te Tuutaw hanlan masaty athae nynh thua hae. <verse number="5" style="v" />Mih munglae kya hynbya um khyh, pawccecize minmin tuh ccaenaw hoi khyh hae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14.5: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ZEP 3:13">Zef 3.13</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="s1">Vaaw hae Lu Thum</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tukoute vaawlang angaelung kya azoupaw ccangpaw vaawpaw kha ka muih; aning tuh laephi vawlan um hae paw ram miakaw, phin miakaw, bya miakaw te minphuin miakaw kalan hopya lanpaw zungzae atynpaw thehoypaw a hoitu nynh thua. <verse number="7" style="v" />Aning nynh roi accae lante ho zah, “Pachia raw kha rih oh lah, thehoysah oh; pawccecize a byapianaw ccyh tuh yn thua vae; vaawlang, laephi, rili te tuidy a raetupaw kha beik oh,” a ci.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ccangpaw vaawpaw, lu ningnawpaw nynh zuikuh zah, “Alesaepaw Babilon khuapi tuh a khuliakuh vae, a khuliakuh vae, pawccecize anungsikuhpaw a ohhuakunaw athuapaw misutui kha minphuin hae balyn pong a niasah hae,” a ci.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14.8: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 21:9">Isa 21.9</ref>; <ref loc="JER 51:8">Jer 51.8</ref>; <ref loc="REV 18:2">Bya 18.2</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ccangpaw vaawpaw, lu thumnawpaw nynh minmin kha zui hae zah, “Ccungccaw lukhakheit nynh sarepaw te tuh-e sarepaw azuh kha beik zah, tuh-e sarepaw kya-e syntawnaw tuh a terui kya khyhze a kuih kya a hoi lanze, <verse number="10" style="v" />tuh-e paw tuh Pachia thinrianaw banang lungkhu lang pawpaw mah pyde leite a ccae hae paw Pachia thinrianaw athuapaw misutui kha a neih cih; tuh-e paw tuh athyaapaw vaaw hae malang te Tuutaw malang khe maee te kemaee khate thawte vawsawnaw a pya cih hae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14.10: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 51:17">Isa 51.17</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 19:24">Gen 19.24</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 38:22">Eze 38.22</ref></char></note> <verse number="11" style="v" />Minmin nynh a teing hae paw vawsawnaw maeekhuh tuh zungzae te zungzae cia a kaethung; sarepaw te sarepaw azuh a beik hae paw te sarepaw min syntawnaw tazeih a mue hae paw tuh khuazi khuadae haeung khyh hae,” cite roi accae lante a ho.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14.11: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 34:10">Isa 34.10</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Hynh-e kyahin Pachia kawbya zui hae zah Jesu kya zynnaw a hoi hae paw mithyaa hae tuh ngaesangnaw a hoi hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Vaawlang te roi nynh, “Hynh-e hynh zei: Atu ccyh kyate Bawipaw kya a chih hae paw tuh hythuanaw a ccou hae paw nynh thua,” cite yn hopyapaw kha ka thae. Muisaw nynh, “Athua ccaccing, minmin tuh mih ryalaw kyate a haeung vae cih hae, pawccecize mih ryalawnaw nynh minmin kha a zui hae!” a ci.</para>
  <para style="s1">Laephi Loohruenaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tukoute ka do zah, maeking rawpaw a um; ccungccaw alopaw nynh a lu vawlan bawilukhung kha khungkuh zah a kuih kya rungkou ahepaw kha ccyngkute tuh-e maeking vawlan khe a haung.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14.14: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 7:13">Dan 7.13</ref></char></note> <verse number="15" style="v" />Ccangpaw vaawpaw nynh beikinn lungkhu te yn pou zah maeking vawlan a haungpaw kyakhe, “Na rungkou kha mang lah loohrue ccavae, pawccecize loohrue ccyh azaw vae, laephi kya-e loohrue lanpaw tuh avoi vae,” cite thawte sia zah a hopya.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14.15: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOL 3:13">Joe 3.13</ref></char></note> <verse number="16" style="v" />Maeking vawlan a haungpaw nynh a rungkou kha laephi vawlan hang zah laephi kya-e looh kha a rue vae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Ccangpaw vaawpaw tuh vaawlang a umpaw beikinn lungkhu te yn pou, aning mah rungkou ahepaw a hoibua. <verse number="18" style="v" />Maee tungvaw kaw a hoitu, ccangpaw vaawpaw tuh silawhang kyate yn pou; aning nynh rungkou ahepaw a ccyngkuhpaw kalan khe thawte sia zah, “Na rungkou ahepaw kha mohsua lah, laephi kya-e misu thae ange hae kha suelua, pawccecize misu thae tuh avoi vae,” cite a hopya. <verse number="19" style="v" />Vaawpaw nynh a rungkou kha laephi vawlan khe mohsua zah, laephi kya-e misu ange kha a suelua; tuh-e tuh Pachia thinrianaw athuapaw myarya lepaw misu mianawpaw akhu lungkhu langkhe moh a phang. <verse number="20" style="v" />Khuapi atolang umpaw misu mianawpaw akhu kyakhe miade thua zah, tuin kyate chii tuh marang khabaw se phe thua lante pou zah, me za ning loukaw cia a thua.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14.20: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 63:3">Isa 63.3</ref>; <ref loc="LAM 1:15">Raw 1.15</ref>; <ref loc="REV 19:15">Bya 19.15</ref></char></note></para>
  <chapter number="15" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Vaaw hae te Nyathyakou Shethya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Alesaepaw te ngaeang lan umpaw ccangpaw muihsahnaw kha vaawlang khe ka muih, tuh-e tuh nyathyakou e shethya ccangsari a hoi hae paw vaaw hae lu sari nynh thua; pawccecize tuh-e shethya hae tuh Pachia thinrianaw a thangnaw nynh thua.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Maee te apykuhpaw thawlang rili alopaw kha ka muih; sarepaw, sarepaw azuh, sarepaw kya-e syntawnaw te a min namba tungvaw taenaw a hoi hae paw nynh Pachia tintang hae kha ccyngkuh hae zah thawlang rili kin khe a thadyn hae paw kha ka muih. <verse number="3" style="v" />Minmin nynh Pachia ryalahtu Moses hlaw te Tuutaw hlaw kha sah hae zah,</para>
  <para style="q1">“Athung huaccepaw Bawipaw Pachia,</para>
  <para style="q2">na ryalaw hae tuh lesae zah</para>
  <para style="q1">ngaeang lan a um!</para>
  <para style="q2">Minphuin hae Siapharan,</para>
  <para style="q2">na laanpi hae tuh ding zah ahme!<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15.3: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 15:1">Exo 15.1</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Pou Bawipaw, hummou na rawri leite,</para>
  <para style="q2">na min kha phu-esah leite a um cih?</para>
  <para style="q1">Pawccecize nang rou nynh</para>
  <para style="q2">athyaapaw na thua.</para>
  <para style="q1">Bya na piapaw balyn tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">a langku vae keiccuze</para>
  <para style="q1">minphuin hae balyn nynh</para>
  <para style="q2">oun thua cih hae zah</para>
  <para style="q1">ae beik cih hae,”</para>
  <para style="m">a ci hae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15.4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 10:7">Jer 10.7</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 86:9">Sam 86.9</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tukoute he ka do tuh, vaawlang kya ccaekiakhankunaw bu a umnaw beikinn tuh ahungkuh.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15.5: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 38:21">Exo 38.21</ref></char></note> <verse number="6" style="v" />Shethya ccangsari a hoi hae paw vaaw hae lu sari tuh beikinn lungkhu te oun pou hae; minmin tuh dalahdalah ak zah thyaararihpaw boeining arawpaw kha lawkuh hae zah mih by kya sui taeccia a cciakuh hae. <verse number="7" style="v" />Ahiinpaw sarangpaw hae sa pali kyaze sa kheit nynh zungzae te zungzae cia ahiinpaw Pachia a thinrianaw te phe beihpaw sui pakekhupaw ccangsari kha vaaw hae lu sari kalan khe a pya hae. <verse number="8" style="v" />Beikinn tuh Pachia a phu-enaw te a thungnaw maeekhuh te phe abeih; te vaaw hae lu sari kya-e shethya ccangsari athang makhia tuh hum sanmah beikinn lungkhu lang tee kho khyh.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15.8: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 40:34">Exo 40.34</ref>; <ref loc="1KI 8:10-11">1Si 8.10-11</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 5:13-14">2Sh 5.13-14</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 6:4">Isa 6.4</ref></char></note></para>
  <chapter number="16" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Pachia Thinrianaw Pakekhupaw hae</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Beikinn lungkhu te myarya accaepaw roi nynh, “La cceih oh lah, Pachia thinrianaw athuapaw pakekhupaw ccangsari kha laephi vawlan ccae oh,” cite vaaw hae lu sari kalan a hopya hae paw kha ka thae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Masaty e vaawpaw nynh cceih zah a pakekhupaw kha laephi vawlan khe a ccae; te sarepaw kya-e syntawnaw a hoi hae paw te sarepaw azuh a beik hae paw tungvaw kyakhe myarya dothah zah luathua-ae-ui lan umpaw te myarya ccihpaw balyh nynh a thuanua hae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16.2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 9:10">Exo 9.10</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Lu ningnaw e vaawpaw nynh a pakekhupaw kha rili vawlan khe a ccae; rili tuh ccungccaw achihpaw chii hawte chii lang phe a tang; rili kya umpaw a hiinpaw miakaw marya a chih hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Lu thumnaw e vaawpaw nynh a pakekhupaw kha vawpi hae te tuidy hae vawlan khe a ccae; tuh-e hae tuh chii lang phe a tang.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16.4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 7:17-21">Exo 7.17-21</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 78:44">Sam 78.44</ref></char></note> <verse number="5" style="v" />Tui a uktu vaawpaw nynh,</para>
  <para style="q1">“Atu a umpaw, langmawlya</para>
  <para style="q2">a la um vae paw, pou Athyaapaw,</para>
  <para style="q1">nang tuh na ding,</para>
  <para style="q2">pawccecize nang nynh</para>
  <para style="q2">hynh-e hae hynh bya na pia.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Minmin nynh mithyaa hae chii te</para>
  <para style="q2">profeh hae chii kha luasah hae zah,</para>
  <para style="q1">nang nynh minmin a nia lan hae paw</para>
  <para style="q2">chii kha na pya hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">Minmin tuh tuhcite teing lan</para>
  <para style="q2">a ngaekuh hae paw nynh thua,”</para>
  <para style="m">cite a hopaw kha ka thae. <verse number="7" style="v" />Ccangpaw vaawpaw nynh silawhang kyate,</para>
  <para style="q1">“Athung huaccepaw</para>
  <para style="q2">Bawipaw Pachia, na byapianaw tuh</para>
  <para style="q1">hme zah adingpaw nynh thua!”</para>
  <para style="m">cite a hopaw kha ka thae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Lu palinaw e vaawpaw nynh a pakekhupaw kha khuanin vawlan khe a ccae; khuanin tuh ccungccaw hae kha maee te unaw kaw a mue. <verse number="9" style="v" />Myarya asopaw maeeso khate ccungccaw hae kha u thua hae zah, hynh-e shethya hae tungvaw kaw a hoitupaw Pachia min kha thya a law hae; minmin tuh ngaesikuh khyh hae, Pachia kha mah phu-enaw pya khyh hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Lu pangawnaw e vaawpaw nynh a pakekhupaw kha sarepaw kya-e bawitungkhung vawlan khe a ccae; a peenaw tuh mohnaw te phe beih zah, eih acci keiccuze ccungccaw hae nynh mih lae kha a teiku hae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16.10: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 10:21">Exo 10.21</ref></char></note> <verse number="11" style="v" />Minmin nynh a teing hae paw mih vaemaw te mih balyh hae keiccuze vaawlang e Pachia kha thyalaw hae zah, mih cyisahnaw kha ngaesikuh khyh hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Lu taruhnaw e vaawpaw nynh a pakekhupaw kha myarya lepaw Zufrates vawpi vawlan khe a ccae; nithua lang e siapharan hae ccianaw kha paccynpya khylan, tuin kya-e tui tuh phe akan.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16.12: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 11:15">Isa 11.15</ref></char></note> <verse number="13" style="v" />Nakaa-hupi khalang, sarepaw khalang te ahme leipaw profeh khalang kyate buphaw te alokuhpaw athupaw muisaw hae ccangthum yn poupaw kha ka muih. <verse number="14" style="v" />Tuh-e muisaw hae tuh muihsahnaw hae a langsakuhpaw raerangsaro hae kya-e muisaw hae nynh thua; Athung huaccepaw Pachia kya-e alesaepaw nin kya rhawtukku khylan minmin nynh laephi pynpi kya-e siapharan hae kha ccianua hae zah a suelua hae. <verse number="15" style="v" />(“Dotua, kae tuh miruh hawte nynh kae thua! A ccakaete a ccia khyh nawlan te a maethyanaw alang khyh nawlan a uccaw kha a rinkuhpaw te ngaw a dokuhpaw tuh hythua a ccoupaw nynh thua!”)<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16.15: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 24:43-44">Mat 24.43-44</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 12:39-40">Luk 12.39-40</ref>; <ref loc="REV 3:3">Bya 3.3</ref></char></note> <verse number="16" style="v" />Tuh-e muisaw hae nynh siapharan hae kha Hebru bya te Armageddon a ci hae paw hmin kyakhe nynh a suelua hae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16.16: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 23:29">2Si 23.29</ref>; <ref loc="ZEC 12:11">Zek 12.11</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Lu sarinaw e vaawpaw nynh a pakekhupaw kha khivae kyakhe a ccae; vaawlang e beikinn kya umpaw bawitungkhung kyate myarya accaepaw roi yn pou zah, “Athang vae!” a ci. <verse number="18" style="v" />Khozawlaekunaw, roiccaenaw, kholungthyhnaw te myarya rupaw innrysuekunaw a um; laephi vawlan ccungccaw a um takaw te tuhcih arupaw te tuhcih alepaw innrysuekuhpaw tuh um boi khyh.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16.18: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 8:5">Bya 8.5</ref>, <ref loc="REV 11:13">11.13</ref>, <ref loc="REV 11:19">19</ref></char></note> <verse number="19" style="v" />Myarya lepaw khuapi tuh san thum lang phia thua zah, minphuin hae kya-e khuapi hae tuh phe ating. Pachia nynh a thinrianaw te asekuhpaw bungpawnaw misutui banang kha niasah khylan myarya lepaw Babilon khuapi kha a liathui vae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16.19: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 51:17">Isa 51.17</ref></char></note> <verse number="20" style="v" />Tuikoih miakaw tuh pong ccue hae zah, mua hae tuh muih lan um vae khyh hae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16.20: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 6:14">Bya 6.14</ref></char></note> <verse number="21" style="v" />Pung za kheit loukaw aripaw myarya lepaw hya tuh ccungccaw hae tungvaw khe vaawlang te a ccah. Tuh-e shethya tuh myaryamaw ccih zah, tuh-e hya te asekuhpaw shethya keiccuze ccungccaw hae nynh Pachia kha thya a law hae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16.21: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 9:23">Exo 9.23</ref>; <ref loc="REV 11:19">Bya 11.19</ref></char></note></para>
  <chapter number="17" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Ohhuanung Lepaw te Sarepaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tuinte pakekhupaw ccangsari a hoipaw vaaw hae lu sari kyaze lukheitpaw nynh yn cceih zah yn hopyapaw tuh, “Rang, tui patae vawlan a haungpaw ohhuanung lepaw tungvaw byapianaw kha kae muihsah cih;<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17.1: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 51:13">Jer 51.13</ref></char></note> <verse number="2" style="v" />laephi siapharan hae nynh tuh-e nung te a ohhuakuh hae; laephi vaw a um hae paw tuh tuh-e nung kya-e ohhuakunaw misutui khate pong a rui vae hae,” a ci.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17.2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 23:17">Isa 23.17</ref>; <ref loc="JER 51:7">Jer 51.7</ref></char></note> <verse number="3" style="v" />Tuhcite Muisaw liate kae kha ramkaw lang yn cciakhae; alu lu sari te aki ki haw hoi zah Pachia thethyasahnawpaw min hae te phe beihpaw sarepaw sekakungpaw vawlan a haungpaw nopinung kha ka muih.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17.3: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 13:1">Bya 13.1</ref></char></note> <verse number="4" style="v" />Nopinung tuh sephaphuhpaw te asepaw boeining kha lawkuh zah sui, aphutepaw lung hae te palee hae khate a ccaankuh; a ohhuakunaw kya-e luathua-ae-ui lan umpaw te myarya anungsikuhpaw sui banang kha a kuih kya a ccyngbia.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17.4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 51:7">Jer 51.7</ref></char></note> <verse number="5" style="v" />A terui kyakhe, “Alesaepaw Babilon, ohhua hae nung te laephi kya-e luathua-ae-ui lan umpaw nung,” cite byakhu lante min azeikuh.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Nopinung tuh mithyaa hae chii te Jesu a zyn hae keiccu a chia hae paw chii khate a ruipaw kha ka muih, tuh-e nung kha he ka muih tuh, myarya ka ngaeangthua. <verse number="7" style="v" />Vaawpaw nynh, “Pawccemou na ngaeangthua? Tuh-e nopinung kya-e byakhupaw te tuh-e nung a cciakhaepaw alu lu sari te aki ki haw a hoipaw sarepaw kya-e byakhupaw kha kae hopah ung cih. <verse number="8" style="v" />Na muihpaw sarepaw tuh langmawlya la um zah atu um khyh, adianaw um lei lan akhupaw laekarung lungkhu te yn kaethung cih zah ronaw kalan a cceih cih; laephi vawlan um hae zah laephi athotakaw te hiinnaw ccauh kya mih min zei athua lei hae paw nynh langmawlya la um zah atu a um leipaw, te bua yn langkuh cih paw sarepaw kha he oun muih hae tuh, mih ngaeangthua cih.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17.8: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 7:7">Dan 7.7</ref>; <ref loc="REV 11:7">Bya 11.7</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 69:28">Sam 69.28</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />“Hein kyahin hawnaw te nythyanaw hoi aho: alu lu sari tuh nopinung nynh a haungnawpaw mua muasari nynh thua; <verse number="10" style="v" />siapharan hae lu sari mah a um hae; lu pangaw tuh a ccahbung vae hae, lu kheit tuh a um ung; ccangpaw lu kheit tuh yn thua loh khyh; aning tuh he yn thua te, ccyh dyntari rou nynh atyn cih. <verse number="11" style="v" />Langmawlya la um zah atu a um leipaw sarepaw tuh lu taryanaw e siapharan nynh thua, aning tuh lu sari kya a um buapaw mah thua zah, ronaw kalan a cceih cih. <verse number="12" style="v" />Na muihpaw aki ki haw tuh siapharan kawhoinaw a mue loh leipaw siapharan lu haw hae nynh thua; thuasalama siapharan hae hawte kawhoinaw kha sarepaw ryte suimilan ccangkheit lungkhu a muekheih cih hae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17.12: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 7:24">Dan 7.24</ref></char></note> <verse number="13" style="v" />Tuh-e hae tuh tuanaw ccangkheit a hoi hae paw thua zah mih thungnaw te kawhoinaw kha sarepaw kalan a pya cih hae. <verse number="14" style="v" />Tuh-e hae nynh Tuutaw kha rhaw a tuk cih hae zah Tuutaw nynh minmin kha a tae cih hae, pawccecize Tuutaw tuh bawi hae Bawipaw te siapharan hae Siapharan nynh thua; amaw ryte a umkheih hae paw tuh ko athua hae paw, po athua hae paw te mih lungzipaw nynh thua hae,” yn cipya.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Vaawpaw nynh, “Ohhuanung nynh a haungnawpaw tui na muihpaw tuh minphuin hae, ccungccaw zapi hae, ram hae te bya hae nynh thua. <verse number="16" style="v" />Na muihpaw aki ki haw hae te sarepaw nynh ohhuanung kha a hua cih hae, a uccaw miakaw kha a ropah cih hae zah a ccakaete a nung cih hae; a ngesaw kha a ae cih hae zah amaw kha maee te a u cih hae. <verse number="17" style="v" />Pawccecize Pachia bya accing mawlaezung, a rynaw kha ccingsah khylan, minmin kha lunglokunaw hoisah te minmin kya-e siapharan kawhoinaw kha sarepaw kalan pya lan Pachia nynh mih thinlung kya phe a sang vae. <verse number="18" style="v" />Na muihpaw nopinung tuh laephi siapharan hae a uktupaw, myarya lepaw khuapi kha nynh thua,” cite yn hopya.</para>
  <chapter number="18" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Babilon Ronaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tukoute myarya lepaw kawhoinaw a hoipaw ccangpaw vaawpaw nynh vaawlang te yn rungbungpaw kha ka muih; a phu-enaw khate laephi tuh phaephae a aw. <verse number="2" style="v" />Aning nynh roi accae lante thawte sia zah,</para>
  <para style="q1">“Myarya lepaw Babilon tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">a khuliakuh vae, a khuliakuh vae!</para>
  <para style="q1">Raerangsaro hae umnaw lang nynh</para>
  <para style="q2">a tang vae, anungsikuhpaw</para>
  <para style="q1">muisaw miakaw elang thonginn lang,</para>
  <para style="q2">te athyaa leipaw te hua lan umpaw</para>
  <para style="q1">pavaw miakaw elang</para>
  <para style="q2">rekunaw lang nynh a tang vae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18.2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 13:21">Isa 13.21</ref>, <ref loc="ISA 21:9">21.9</ref>; <ref loc="JER 50:39">Jer 50.39</ref>, <ref loc="JER 51:8">51.8</ref>; <ref loc="REV 14:8">Bya 14.8</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Pawccecize minphuin hae balyn nynh</para>
  <para style="q2">a ohhuakunaw te asekuhpaw</para>
  <para style="q1">athyaa leipaw misutui kha a nia vae hae;</para>
  <para style="q2">laephi siapharan hae tuh</para>
  <para style="q1">amaw ryte a ohhuakuh vae hae;</para>
  <para style="q2">laephi vaw e kungku hae tuh</para>
  <para style="q1">tuh-e nopinung a ohhuakunaw kya-e sisua liate</para>
  <para style="q2">a hoirum vae hae,” a ci.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18.3: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 23:17">Isa 23.17</ref>; <ref loc="JER 51:7">Jer 51.7</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tuinte vaawlang te ccangpaw roi kha</para>
  <para style="q1">ka thae zah tuh-e roi nynh,</para>
  <para style="q1">“Ka ccungccaw hae, nanning tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">tuh-e nung a seinaw kya</para>
  <para style="q1">na umbua khyh nawlan oh thuasah,</para>
  <para style="q2">aning nynh a teing lanpaw shethya kya</para>
  <para style="q1">na umbua khyh nawlan oh thuasah</para>
  <para style="q2">amaw kyate oun pou oh.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18.4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 48:20">Isa 48.20</ref>; <ref loc="JER 50:8">Jer 50.8</ref>, <ref loc="JER 51:6">51.6</ref>, <ref loc="JER 51:45">45</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Pawccecize a seinaw tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">vaaw cia phe phah vae zah</para>
  <para style="q1">a hoyleinaw kha</para>
  <para style="q2">Pachia nynh a liathui vae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18.5: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 18:20-21">Gen 18.20-21</ref>; <ref loc="JER 51:9">Jer 51.9</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Aning nynh ae cyi oh hawte</para>
  <para style="q2">cyihru oh; a cyisahnaw thyhte</para>
  <para style="q1">leit ning liaru oh; aning nynh</para>
  <para style="q2">a pydepaw banang kyakhe</para>
  <para style="q2">leit ning pydepah oh.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18.6: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 137:8">Sam 137.8</ref>; <ref loc="JER 50:29">Jer 50.29</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Aning nynh amaw te amaw kha</para>
  <para style="q2">myarya a phu-esakuh zah</para>
  <para style="q1">ohhuakunaw kya a hoysah hawkhate</para>
  <para style="q2">vawsawnaw te rawkhuinaw kha</para>
  <para style="q1">pyaru oh; pawccecize aning nynh</para>
  <para style="q2">a thinlung kyakhe,</para>
  <para style="q1">‘Kae tuh siapharannung nynh ka thua,</para>
  <para style="q2">nomae ka thua khyh,</para>
  <para style="q1">rawkhuinaw tuh ka tung lan khyh,’</para>
  <para style="m">a ciku.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18.7-8: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 47:7-9">Isa 47.7-9</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tukeiccuze aning nynh</para>
  <para style="q2">shethya hae athuapaw chinaw,</para>
  <para style="q1">rawkhuinaw te ccakannaw kha</para>
  <para style="q2">nin kheit lungkhu a tung cih zah,</para>
  <para style="q1">maee nynh pong a u cih;</para>
  <para style="q2">pawccecize amaw kha</para>
  <para style="q1">bya a piatupaw Bawipaw Pachia tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">a thawsaepaw nynh thua,” a ci.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Amaw ryte ohhuakuh hae zah ohhuakunaw kya a hoysah kheih hae paw laephi siapharan hae nynh a rhua a uunaw hae paw maeekhuh kha he a muih hae tuh, amaw elang a rah a khui cih hae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18.9-10: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 26:16-17">Eze 26.16-17</ref></char></note> <verse number="10" style="v" />Aning nynh a teingpaw vawsawnaw kha minmin nynh a ri hae keiccuze asawnaw langkhe thadyn hae zah,</para>
  <para style="q1">“Ezou, ezou! Khuh-e myarya lepaw</para>
  <para style="q2">khuapi, athungpaw</para>
  <para style="q1">Babilon khuapi khuhlou!</para>
  <para style="q2">Suimilan ccangkheit lungkhu</para>
  <para style="q1">byapianaw nynh ae thuanua vae rei!”</para>
  <para style="m">a ci cih hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Laephi vaw e kungku hae tuh amaw elang oun rah oun khui cih hae; pawccecize mih uccaw hae kha hum nynh sanmah repah vae lan khyh hae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18.11: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 27:31">Eze 27.31</ref>, <ref loc="EZK 27:36">36</ref></char></note> <verse number="12" style="v" />Mih kungkunaw uccaw hae sui, ngun, aphutepaw lung hae, palee hae, nebaleihpaw boeining , kadipa uccaw, po-uccaw, sekakungpaw uccaw, amynkhuhpaw thing aphuinphuin, saepanua te raepaw uccaw aphuinphuin, aphutepaw thing te raepaw uccaw aphuinphuin, sohin uccaw, sivaw uccaw te lung rawpaw uccaw,<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18.12-13: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 27:12">Eze 27.12</ref>, <ref loc="EZK 27:13">13</ref>, <ref loc="EZK 27:22">22</ref></char></note> <verse number="13" style="v" />cinnamon te mynkhuhpaw upaw, zimuin te frankinsen, misutui te oliv chitui, chanvuih akhuipaw te chanvuih, sahiin hae te tuu hae, marang hae te marangle hae, see hae te ccungccaw hiinnaw hae kha hum nynh san re vae lan khyh hae. <verse number="14" style="v" />Kungku hae nynh,</para>
  <para style="q1">“Na thinlung kyate kou na duaapaw</para>
  <para style="q2">thingthae hae tuh na kyate a zo vae hae,</para>
  <para style="q1">na hoysahnawpaw uccaw hae te</para>
  <para style="q2">na phu-enaw balyn tuh</para>
  <para style="q1">na kyate a zo vae hae, tuh-e hae tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">kharouh na muih boi vae lan khyh!”</para>
  <para style="m">a ci hae. <verse number="15" style="v" />Tuh-e khuapi kya-e uccaw hae khate kungku hae zah a hoirum hae paw kungkutu hae tuh tuh-e nung nynh a teingpaw vawsawnaw kha a ri hae keiccuze asawnaw langkhe a thadyn cih hae zah rawkhuite,<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18.15: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 27:31">Eze 27.31</ref>, <ref loc="EZK 27:36">36</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />“Ezou, ezou, nebaleihpaw boeining,</para>
  <para style="q2">sephaphuhpaw te asepaw</para>
  <para style="q1">boeining kha lawkuh zah</para>
  <para style="q2">sui te aphutepaw lung hae,</para>
  <para style="q1">palee hae te a ccaankuhpaw</para>
  <para style="q2">khuh-e myarya lepaw khualipi khuhlou!</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Khahcih alungpaw sisua hae tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">suimilan ccangkheit lungkhu</para>
  <para style="q1">accakaepaw lang phe a tang vae rei,”</para>
  <para style="m">oun ci cih hae.</para>
  <para style="p">Sanphalung uktu hae balyn, sanphalung kya a cceihbua hae paw balyn, sanphalung mawng hae paw, rili kya kungku hae paw balyn nynh asawnaw langkhe thadyn hae zah,<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18.17: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 23:14">Isa 23.14</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 27:26-30">Eze 27.26-30</ref></char></note> <verse number="18" style="v" />khuapi a unawpaw maeekhuh kha he a muih hae tuh,</para>
  <para style="q1">“Khuh-e myarya lepaw khuapi te</para>
  <para style="q2">alokuhpaw paw khuapi mou a um?”</para>
  <para style="m">cite a sia hae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18.18: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 27:32">Eze 27.32</ref></char></note> <verse number="19" style="v" />Minmin nynh laenoi kha mih lu vawlan phingkuh hae zah,</para>
  <para style="q1">“Ezou, ezou, rili kya a cceihpaw</para>
  <para style="q2">sanphalung hae a hoitu hae balyn kha</para>
  <para style="q1">amaw a hoirumnaw liate</para>
  <para style="q2">a hoirumsah bua hae paw</para>
  <para style="q1">khuh-e khuapi khuhlou!</para>
  <para style="q2">Suimilan ccangkheit lungkhu</para>
  <para style="q1">phe roh vae rei.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18.19: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 27:30-34">Eze 27.30-34</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Pou vaawlang, pou mithyaa hae,</para>
  <para style="q2">locceihtu hae te profeh hae,</para>
  <para style="q2">nae lungtua sah!</para>
  <para style="q1">Pawccecize Pachia nynh</para>
  <para style="q2">nanning hanlan amaw kha</para>
  <para style="q1">bya a pia vae!”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18.20: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 32:43">Deu 32.43</ref>; <ref loc="JER 51:48">Jer 51.48</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="m">cite rawkhuite a sia hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tukoute a thawsaepaw vaawpaw nynh myarya lepaw sungmia-lung alopaw lung ccangkheit kha lawkuh zah rili lungkhu lang vua zah,</para>
  <para style="q1">“Babilon khualipi tuh hynhcite</para>
  <para style="q2">myarya ccih lan vua athua cih zah,</para>
  <para style="q2">kharouh muih lei lan vae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18.21: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 51:63-64">Jer 51.63-64</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 26:21">Eze 26.21</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tintang a khua hae paw roi,</para>
  <para style="q2">tyngdaw a khua hae paw roi,</para>
  <para style="q1">phyly a tu hae paw roi,</para>
  <para style="q2">mungkae a tu hae paw roi kha</para>
  <para style="q1">na kya kharouh thae lei lan vae;</para>
  <para style="q2">a kuihhae hoypaw ccungccaw lu kheit san</para>
  <para style="q1">na kya muih lei lan vae;</para>
  <para style="q2">te sungmia-lung roi mah na kya</para>
  <para style="q2">kharouh thae lei lan vae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18.22: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 26:13">Eze 26.13</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 24:8">Isa 24.8</ref></char></note><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18.22-23: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 7:34">Jer 7.34</ref>, <ref loc="JER 25:10">25.10</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Maeekhua a awnaw mah</para>
  <para style="q2">na kya kharouh aw vae lan khyh;</para>
  <para style="q1">te zudy ccangvaepaw te</para>
  <para style="q2">akaepaw liaccanung roi mah</para>
  <para style="q1">na kya kharouh thae lei lan vae;</para>
  <para style="q2">pawccecize na kungku hae tuh</para>
  <para style="q1">laephi kya alesaepaw</para>
  <para style="q2">ccungccaw hae nynh thua hae;</para>
  <para style="q1">pawccecize minphuin hae balyn tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">naaw na thyanaw khate ling athua hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Profeh hae chii, mithyaa hae chii te</para>
  <para style="q2">laephi vawlan chia athua</para>
  <para style="q1">hae paw balyn chii tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">tuh-e khuapi kya muih athua,” a ci.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18.24: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 51:49">Jer 51.49</ref></char></note></para>
  <chapter number="19" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Vaawlang kya Lungtuanaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tukoute vaawlang a umpaw ccungccaw zapi patae roi tahawpaw myarya accaepaw roi kha ka thae zah,</para>
  <para style="q1">“Hallelujah!</para>
  <para style="q1">Khumnaw, phu-enaw te thungnaw tuh</para>
  <para style="q1">ah Pachia kya-e nynh thua.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Pawccecize a byapianaw tuh</para>
  <para style="q1">kyh zah ading;</para>
  <para style="q1">ohhuakunaw a raenaw te laephi a rosahpaw</para>
  <para style="q1">ohhuanung lepaw kha bya a pia vae;</para>
  <para style="q1">tuh-e nung kuih te luasah athuapaw</para>
  <para style="q1">Pachia ryalahtu hae chiise hanlan</para>
  <para style="q1">a tungvaw a liaru vae,” a ci hae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19.2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 32:43">Deu 32.43</ref>; <ref loc="2KI 9:7">2Si 9.7</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Minmin nynh, “Hallelujah!</para>
  <para style="q1">A maeekhuh tuh zungzae te</para>
  <para style="q1">zungzae cia a kaethung,”</para>
  <para style="m">bua a sia hae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19.3: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 34:10">Isa 34.10</ref></char></note> <verse number="4" style="v" />Piccan hae lu kuin lae pali te ahiinpaw sarangpaw hae sa pali nynh bakhung hae zah bawitungkhung vawlan a haungpaw Pachia kha beik hae zah,</para>
  <para style="q1">“Amen, Hallelujah!”</para>
  <para style="m">a ci hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Bawitungkhung kyate roi yn ccae zah,</para>
  <para style="q1">“Pachia ryalahtu hae balyn te</para>
  <para style="q2">amaw raw a rih hae paw</para>
  <para style="q1">adih te ale balyn,</para>
  <para style="q2">ah Pachia kha thehoysah oh,”</para>
  <para style="m">a ci.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19.5: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 115:13">Sam 115.13</ref></char></note> <verse number="6" style="v" />Tukoute ccungccaw zapi patae roi, tuiphue hae patae roi, myarya athungpaw riakawpaw roi te alokuhpaw roi kha ka thae zah, tuh-e roi nynh,</para>
  <para style="q1">“Hallelujah!</para>
  <para style="q2">Pawccecize Athungpaw</para>
  <para style="q2">Bawipaw ah Pachia nynh a uk.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19.6: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 1:24">Eze 1.24</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 93:1">Sam 93.1</ref>, <ref loc="PSA 97:1">97.1</ref>, <ref loc="PSA 99:1">99.1</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ah lungtua sah lah, ah lungpaw sah;</para>
  <para style="q2">amaw kha phu-enaw pya oh sih;</para>
  <para style="q1">pawccecize Tuutaw zudy poi tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">yn thua vae, a liaccanung tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">a paccynkuh vae,” a ci.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tuh-e nung tuh nebaleihpaw,</para>
  <para style="q2">athyaapaw te arawpaw boeining te</para>
  <para style="q1">ccaankunaw kaw a mue;</para>
  <para style="m">pawccecize nebaleihpaw boeining tuh mithyaa hae kya-e adingpaw cyisahnaw nynh thua.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Vaawpaw nynh, “Tuutaw zudy poi zerya mangnaw kalan kobua athua hae paw tuh hythua a ccou hae paw nynh thua cite zei,” cite kae kha yn hopya. Aning nynh, “Hynh-e bya tuh Pachia bya ccaccing nynh thua,” yn cipya.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19.9: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 22:2-3">Mat 22.2-3</ref></char></note> <verse number="10" style="v" />Kae tuh amaw kha beik lan cite a cculeihpaw khe ka bakhung; aning nynh, “Hynhte cyih nan! Kae tuh nang te ryalahkheihtu nynh ka thua, Jesu kya-e ccaekia a hoi hae paw na uno hae ryte ryalahkheihtu nynh ka thua, Pachia palia kha beik! Pawccecize Jesu kya-e ccaekia tuh profehbya honaw kya-e muisaw nynh thua,” cite yn hopya.</para>
  <para style="s1">Marang Rawpaw Ccikuhpaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Vaawlang tuh hungkuh zah marang rawpaw sa kheit kha ka muih. Tuh-e marang tungvaw a ccikuhpaw tuh Alungzipaw, Ahmepaw cite ko athua; aning tuh dingnaw te byapia zah rhaw a tuk.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19.11: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 1:1">Eze 1.1</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 96:13">Sam 96.13</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 11:4">Isa 11.4</ref></char></note> <verse number="12" style="v" />A mit tuh maeesoi te lokuh zah, a lu vawlan bawilukhung hae a khungkuh; a tungvaw kyakhe amaw laelan hum nynh san a ny leipaw min azeikuhpaw a hoi.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19.12: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 10:6">Dan 10.6</ref></char></note> <verse number="13" style="v" />Chii kya adungkuhpaw angkiccua kha kikuh zah, a min tuh Pachia Bya a cikuh. <verse number="14" style="v" />Vaawlang e rhawkaw hae nynh arawpaw marang hae kha ccikute, raw zah athyaapaw nebaleihpaw boeining kha lawku biate amaw kha a zui hae. <verse number="15" style="v" />Minphuin hae kha detah nawlan ahepaw thaloi tuh a khalang lungkhu te a pou. Aning nynh minmin kha sivaw hoitang te a uk cih hae; Athung huaccepaw Pachia thinrianaw te asekuhpaw bungpawnaw misu mianaw khu kha aning nynh a syde cih.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19.15: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 2:9">Sam 2.9</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 63:3">Isa 63.3</ref>; <ref loc="JOL 3:13">Joe 3.13</ref>; <ref loc="REV 14:20">Bya 14.20</ref></char></note> <verse number="16" style="v" />A angkiccua vawlan te a phae vawlan khe, “Siapharan hae Siapharan, bawi hae Bawipaw,” cite azeikuhpaw min kha a hoi.</para>
  <para style="s1">Sarepaw te A Rhawkaw hae Shungnaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Vaawpaw lu kheit nynh khuanin kya a thadynpaw kha ka muih, aning nynh vaawlang angaelung kya a zou hae paw pavaw hae balyn kha roi myarya accae lante ko hae zah, “Rang oh lah, alesaepaw Pachia kya-e loohdangkunaw kalan oun sueluakuh oh;<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19.17-18: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 39:17-20">Eze 39.17-20</ref></char></note> <verse number="18" style="v" />siapharan hae ngesaw, rhawbawi hae ngesaw, a thawsaepaw ccungccaw hae ngesaw, marang hae te marang a ccikuh hae paw ngesaw, a luepaw te see, adihpaw te alepaw ccungccaw hae balyn ngesaw kha na ae ccaw oh oun sueluakuh oh,” cite a sia. <verse number="19" style="v" />Sarepaw te laephi siapharan hae te mih rhawkaw hae nynh marang tungvaw a ccikuhpaw te a rhawkaw hae kha rhawtuk khylan oun sueluaku hae paw kha ka muih. <verse number="20" style="v" />Sarepaw kha phe a kyng hae; sarepaw kya-e syntawnaw a hoi hae paw te sarepaw azuh a beik hae paw kha ling hae zah sarepaw malang muihsahnaw a langsakuhpaw lingthya profeh kha mah amaw ryte a kyngbua hae. Hynh-e lu ning hae hynh parouhte a hiin hae pite, kemaee te a ruanaw maee tuili lungkhu lang a vua hae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19.20: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 13:1-18">Bya 13.1-18</ref></char></note> <verse number="21" style="v" />Tuhlaepaw kha marang tungvaw a ccikuhpaw a khalang lungkhu te yn poupaw thaloi khate chia athua hae; te pavaw hae balyn nynh mih ngesaw kha phe byn lan a ae hae.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Kum Thong Kheit</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />A kuih kya adianaw um lei lan akhupaw laekarung toh te myarya lepaw sivawrui a ccyngpaw vaawpaw lu kheit tuh vaawlang te yn rungbungpaw kha ka muih. <verse number="2" style="v" />Aning nynh langmawlya e hupaw, Raerangsaro te Satan athuapaw nakaa-hupi kha kyng zah kum thong kheit lungkhu phang a khii.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20.2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 3:1">Gen 3.1</ref></char></note> <verse number="3" style="v" />Kum thong kheit accing cia minphuin hae kha a ling vae khyh ccaw hae cite amaw kha tuh-e laekarung lungkhu lang vua zah a khawsung koute a vawlan khe tazeih a khia. Kum thong kheit accing koute aning tuh ccyh sosoh supya athua cih.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tuinte bawitungkhung hae te tuh-e vawlan a haung hae paw kha ka muih, minmin tuh byapianaw kaw a mue hae. Sarepaw te sarepaw azuh kha a beik lei hae paw, mih terui kya khyhze mih kuih kya sarepaw syntawnaw a hoi lei hae paw te Jesu ccaekia lang a tang keiccu te Pachia bya keiccuze mih lu pae hae paw mih muisaw hae kha ka muih; minmin tuh oun hiin hae zah Khri ryte kum thong kheit a uk hae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20.4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 7:9">Dan 7.9</ref>, <ref loc="DAN 7:22">22</ref></char></note> <verse number="5" style="v" />Thuasalama tuhlaepaw a chih hae paw tuh kum thong kheit athang makhia bua hiin khyh hae. Hynh-e tuh masaty thoothuinaw nynh thua. <verse number="6" style="v" />Masaty thoothuinaw kya a um buapaw tuh hythua a ccoupaw te a thyaapaw nynh thua. Tuhcihawpaw ccungccaw tungvaw kya vaening chinaw nynh kaw hoi vae khyh; minmin tuh Pachia ranpibawi hae te Khri ranpibawi hae athua vae cih hae zah, Khri ryte kum thong kheit a uk vae cih hae.</para>
  <para style="s1">Satan Shungnaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Kum thong kheit he athang te, Satan tuh thong a ccawnaw kyate supya athua cih zah, <verse number="8" style="v" />laephi ki kipali kya a um hae paw minphuin hae athuapaw Gog te Magog kha ling khylan te rhawtuk khylan minmin kha suelua lan po a cceih cih, minmin tuh milu lante rili laesia zeih a cih hae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20.8: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 7:2">Eze 7.2</ref>, <ref loc="EZK 38:2">38.2</ref>, <ref loc="EZK 38:9">9</ref>, <ref loc="EZK 38:15">15</ref></char></note> <verse number="9" style="v" />Minmin tuh laephi vaw balyn pazaekuh hae zah mithyaa hae umnaw hmin te sungsahpaw khuapi kha po a koihlu hae; thuasalama vaawlang te maee yn ccah zah minmin kha marya a u hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Minmin a lingtu hae paw Satan kha sarepaw te lingthya profeh a umnaw hae, kemaee te maee tuili lungkhu langkhe ccaring vua athua; minmin tuh khuazi khuadae zungzae te zungzae cia vawsawnaw pya athua vae cih hae.</para>
  <para style="s1">Michi hae Byapianaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Myarya lepaw bawitungkhung arawpaw te tuh-e vawlan a haungpaw kha ka muih, tuh-e paw malang kyate vaaw te lae tuh ccue hae zah, mih hanlan umnaw um vae khyh.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20.11-12: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 7:9-10">Dan 7.9-10</ref></char></note> <verse number="12" style="v" />Michi hae adih te ale nynh bawitungkhung malang a thadyn hae paw kha ka muih; te ccauh hae kha a kia hae. Hiinnaw ccauh athuapaw ccangpaw ccauh kha mah kia athua. Michi hae tuh mih ryalaw thyhte, tuh-e ccauh hae kya azeiku thyhte byapia athua hae. <verse number="13" style="v" />Rili nynh a kya umpaw michi hae kha a poukhae. Chinaw te michi khua hae nynh mih kya umpaw michi hae kha a poukhae hae. Ccungccaw hae balyn tuh mih ryalaw thyhte byapia athua hae. <verse number="14" style="v" />Chinaw te michi khua tuh maee tuili lungkhu lang vua athua hae. Tuh-e maee tuili tuh vaening chinaw nynh thua. <verse number="15" style="v" />Hiinnaw ccauh kya a min zei athua leipaw miakaw tuh maee tuili lungkhu lang vua athua hae.</para>
  <chapter number="21" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Vaaw Thawpaw te Laephi Thawpaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tukoute vaaw thawpaw te laephi thawpaw kha ka muih; pawccecize masaty vaaw te masaty laephi tuh zo hae zah rili mah um vae khyh.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21.1: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 65:17">Isa 65.17</ref>, <ref loc="ISA 66:22">66.22</ref>; <ref loc="2PE 3:13">2Pe 3.13</ref></char></note> <verse number="2" style="v" />Athyaapaw khuapi athuapaw Jerusalem Thawpaw tuh a vawpaw hanlan a ccaankuhpaw akaepaw liaccanung hawte paccynkuh zah Pachia kyate vaawlang te yn rungbungpaw kha ka muih.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21.2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 52:1">Isa 52.1</ref>, <ref loc="ISA 61:10">61.10</ref>; <ref loc="REV 3:12">Bya 3.12</ref></char></note> <verse number="3" style="v" />Vaawlang te roi accaepaw nynh,</para>
  <para style="q1">“Dotua oh, Pachia nynh</para>
  <para style="q2">a umnawpaw bu tuh</para>
  <para style="q1">ccungccaw hae kya um zah,</para>
  <para style="q2">Pachia tuh minmin ryte a um vae cih;</para>
  <para style="q1">minmin tuh a ccungccaw hae</para>
  <para style="q2">athua vae cih hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">Pachia tuh minmin ryte a um cih zah</para>
  <para style="q2">mih Pachia athua vae cih.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21.3: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 37:27">Eze 37.27</ref>; <ref loc="LEV 26:11">Lev 26.11</ref>, <ref loc="LEV 26:12">12</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Pachia nynh mih mit kyate</para>
  <para style="q2">mitphi balyn kha a hupah cih hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">Chinaw um vae lan khyh.</para>
  <para style="q2">Ngaethyanaw, rawnaw te ccinaw</para>
  <para style="q1">um vae lan khyh;</para>
  <para style="q2">pawccecize langmawlya e</para>
  <para style="q1">uccaw hae tuh pong azo vae hae,”</para>
  <para style="m">cite a hopaw kha ka thae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21.4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 25:8">Isa 25.8</ref>, <ref loc="ISA 35:10">35.10</ref>, <ref loc="ISA 65:19">65.19</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Bawitungkhung vawlan a haungpaw nynh, “Dotua oh, pawpaw balyn kha athawpaw lang ka rae vae,” a ci. Aning nynh kamaw kha, “Hynh-e hynh zei, pawccecize hynh-e bya tuh zyn lan umpaw te akyhpaw nynh thua,” yn cipya. <verse number="6" style="v" />Aning nynh kamaw kha, “Phe athang vae! Kae tuh Alfa te Omega, athonaw te athangnaw nynh ka thua. A tuihawpaw ccungccaw tuh hiinnaw tuidy kya-e tui kha amee leite ka pya cih.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21.6: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 55:1">Isa 55.1</ref></char></note> <verse number="7" style="v" />A taetupaw tuh hynh-e rho hynh a ccou cih; kae tuh a Pachia ka thua cih zah aning tuh ka ccapaw athua cih.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21.7: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 7:14">2Sa 7.14</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 89:26-27">Sam 89.26-27</ref></char></note> <verse number="8" style="v" />Thuasalama mih rawthah hae paw, a zyn lei hae paw, luathua-ae-ui lan um hae paw, ccungccaw theih hae paw, a ohhuakuh hae paw, naawthya hae paw, zohtuh beik hae paw te a hyn hae paw balyn tuh kemaee te aruapaw maee tuili kyakhe nynh mih hanpaw a hoi cih hae, tuh-e tuh vaening chinaw nynh thua,” yn cipya.</para>
  <para style="s1">Jerusalem Thawpaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Nyathyakou e shethya ccangsari te phe beihpaw pakekhupaw ccangsari a ccyng hae paw vaaw hae lu sari kyaze lu kheit tuh ka kya yn thua. Kae kha bya yn beih zah, “Hynhlang rang, Tuutaw zu, akaepaw liaccanung kha kae muihsah cih,” yn cipya. <verse number="10" style="v" />Aning nynh myarya lepaw te ahangpaw mua kalan khe Muisaw liate yn cciakhae zah, athyaapaw khuapi Jerusalem tuh Pachia kyate vaawlang te yn rungbungpaw kha yn muihsah.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21.10: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 40:2">Eze 40.2</ref></char></note> <verse number="11" style="v" />Tuh-e khuapi tuh Pachia phu-enaw te phe beih zah, a awnaw tuh lung-awmatei hawte accipaw jasper lung hawkhate, aphute huapaw lung te nynh aloku; <verse number="12" style="v" />koikua haw lae ning umpaw myarya lepaw te ahangpaw khualungrua hoi zah, tuh-e koikua hae kyakhe vaaw hae lu haw lae ning a um hae; tuh-e koikua hae kyakhe Israel ccapaw hae phin haw lae ning min kha zei athua.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21.12-13: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 48:30-35">Eze 48.30-35</ref></char></note> <verse number="13" style="v" />Nithua lang koikua ccangthum, palung lang koikua ccangthum, deilang koikua ccangthum, te niccaw lang koikua ccangthum a um. <verse number="14" style="v" />Khuapi kya-e khualungrua tuh athonaw lungbing haw lae ning a um, tuh-e hae kyakhe Tuutaw kya-e locceihtu hae lu haw lae ning min a um.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Kamaw kha bya yn hopahtupaw tuh khuapi kha thuasah, a koikua hae te khualungrua hae kha thuasah tou nawpaw sui ccungngue ccangkheit a hoi.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21.15: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 40:3">Eze 40.3</ref></char></note> <verse number="16" style="v" />Khuapi tuh asaepaw te akopaw alokuh; aning nynh khuapi kha a ccungngue te tou zah asaepaw, akopaw te ahangpaw tuh me thong kheit za pangaw cci cih hae zah a lokuh hae. <verse number="17" style="v" />Khualungrua tuh tou zah vaawpaw kya-e tounawpaw thyhte ccungccaw dung te za kheit sung pali dung pali acih. <verse number="18" style="v" />Khualungrua tuh jasper lung te rae thua zah, khuapi tuh ccirarihpaw thawlang te alokuhpaw sui ccipaw nynh thua.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21.18-21: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 54:11-12">Isa 54.11-12</ref></char></note> <verse number="19" style="v" />Khuapi kya-e khualungrua athonaw aleihpaw hae tuh aphutepaw lung aphuinphuin te a ccaan hae; masaty athonaw aleihpaw tuh jasper lung, ccangningnaw tuh nilar lung, ccangthumnaw tuh agate lung, ccangpalinaw tuh emerald lung; <verse number="20" style="v" />ccangpangawnaw tuh oniks lung, ccangtaruhnaw tuh karnelian lung, ccangsarinaw tuh khrisolaih lung, ccangtaryanaw tuh beril lung, ccangtakuanaw tuh topaz lung, ccanghawnaw tuh khrisoprase lung, haw lae kheitnaw tuh jacinth lung, haw lae ningnaw tuh amethist lung nynh thua. <verse number="21" style="v" />Koikua haw lae ning tuh palee haw lae ning thua zah, koikua ccangkheit cci tuh palee ccangkheit cci nynh thua; khuapi kya-e laanpi tuh thawlang hawte awrarihpaw sui ccipaw nynh thua.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tuh-e khuapi kya beikinn ka muih khyh; pawccecize a beikinn tuh Athung huaccepaw Bawipaw Pachia te Tuutaw tuh nynh thua. <verse number="23" style="v" />Tuh-e khuapi tuh khuanin awnaw te sawpaw awnaw ho vae khyh; pawccecize Pachia phu-enaw nynh tuh-e khuapi tuh awsah zah, Tuutaw tuh khuapi a maeekhua nynh thua.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21.23: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 60:19-20">Isa 60.19-20</ref></char></note> <verse number="24" style="v" />Khumnaw a muepaw minphuin hae nynh tuh-e khuapi a awnaw kyakhe a pae cih hae; laephi siapharan hae nynh mih phu-enaw kha tuh-e khuapi lungkhu lang a thuakhae cih hae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21.24: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 60:3">Isa 60.3</ref></char></note> <verse number="25" style="v" />Khuapi kya-e koikua hae tuh khuadae ccyh kya khaw thua vae lan khyh; pawccecize tuin kya khuazi um vae lan khyh.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21.25-26: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 60:11">Isa 60.11</ref></char></note> <verse number="26" style="v" />Minmin nynh minphuin hae mih phu-enaw te sawtuanaw kha tuh-e khuapi lungkhu lang oun thuakhae cih hae. <verse number="27" style="v" />Anungsikuhpaw uccaw hae kha tuh-e khuapi lungkhu lang teekhae thua lan khyh, luathua-ae-uipaw rya a lahpaw te a hynpaw tuh tuh-e khuapi lungkhu lang kharouh tee lan khyh hae. Tuutaw kya-e hiinnaw ccauh kya min zei athua hae paw rou nynh a tee cih hae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21.27: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 52:1">Isa 52.1</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 44:9">Eze 44.9</ref></char></note></para>
  <chapter number="22" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Hiinnaw Tui</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tuinte vaawpaw nynh Pachia bawitungkhung te Tuutaw bawitungkhung kyate yn luapaw, lung-awmatei hawte awrarihpaw hiinnaw tui vawpi kha yn muihsah.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22.1: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 47:1">Eze 47.1</ref>; <ref loc="ZEC 14:8">Zek 14.8</ref></char></note> <verse number="2" style="v" />Tuh-e vawpi tuh khualae e laanpi angaelung khe lua zah, tuh-e vawpi sirawkhuraw te thingthae phuin haw lae ning a thaepaw hiinnaw thingku a um; tuh-e thingku tuh sawpaw sah takyhte athae thae zah, tuh-e thingku anaw tuh minphuin hae dansahnaw hanlan nynh thua.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22.2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 2:9">Gen 2.9</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 47:12">Eze 47.12</ref></char></note> <verse number="3" style="v" />Thyalawnaw kharouh um vae lan khyh, Pachia kya-e te Tuutaw kya-e bawitungkhung tuh tuh-e khuapi kya a um cih zah, Pachia rya a lawpatu hae nynh amaw kha a beik cih hae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22.3: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ZEC 14:11">Zek 14.11</ref></char></note> <verse number="4" style="v" />Minmin nynh amaw mae kha a muih cih hae zah amaw min tuh mih terui kya zei athua cih. <verse number="5" style="v" />Tuin kya khuazi um vae lan khyh; minmin tuh maeekhua kya-e awnaw te khuanin kya-e awnaw kha ho vae lan khyh, pawccecize Bawipaw Pachia nynh minmin kha awnaw a pya hae, minmin nynh zungzae te zungzae cia a uk vae cih hae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22.5: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 60:19">Isa 60.19</ref>; <ref loc="DAN 7:18">Dan 7.18</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Vaawpaw nynh kamaw kha, “Hynh-e bya tuh zyn lan umpaw te ahmepaw nynh thua. Profeh hae muisaw a peetu Bawipaw Pachia nynh aro mawze yn cyihkuh hahe cih paw uccaw hae kha a ryalahtu hae kalan langsahpya khylan a vaaw ccungccapaw kha yn saw vae,” cite yn hopya.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />“Dotua oh, kae tuh arangte kae thua cih. E ccauh kya-e profehbya hae a zuipaw ccungccaw tuh hythua a ccoupaw nynh thua,” a ci.</para>
  <para style="s1">Thangsahnaw te Nyathya Sawsang</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Kae, Johan nynh hynh-e uccaw hae hynh ka muih zah ka thae. Tuh-e hae tuh ka thae zah he ka muih tuh, hynh-e uccaw hae yn muihsahpaw vaawpaw cculeihpaw khe beik lan cite ka bakhung. <verse number="9" style="v" />Aning nynh, “Hynhte cyih nan! Kae tuh nang te ryalahkheihtu nynh ka thua, na uno hae profeh hae te hynh-e ccauh kya umpaw bya a zui hae paw ryte ryalahkheihtu nynh ka thua. Pachia palia kha beik,” yn cipya.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Aning nynh kamaw kha, “E ccauh kya-e profehbya hae hynh tazeihkhia nan; pawccecize accyh anae vae. <verse number="11" style="v" />Hoyleinaw a raepaw ccungccaw tuh hoyleinaw kha rae ccaleih hin sah, a nungsikuhpaw tuh nungsikuh ccaleih hin sah, a dingpaw tuh ding ccaleih hin sah, a thyaapaw tuh thyaa ccaleih hin sah,” yn cipya.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22.11: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 12:10">Dan 12.10</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />“Dotua oh, kae tuh arangte kae thua cih; ccungccaw miakaw kha a ryalaw thyhte pya khylan ka kya-e ryalaw mee kha kae ccyngbia cih.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22.12: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 40:10">Isa 40.10</ref>, <ref loc="ISA 62:11">62.11</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 28:4">Sam 28.4</ref>; <ref loc="JER 17:10">Jer 17.10</ref></char></note> <verse number="13" style="v" />Kae tuh Alfa te Omega, athonaw te athangnaw, masaty te nyathyakou nynh ka thua,” a ci.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22.13: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 1:8">Bya 1.8</ref>, <ref loc="REV 1:17">17</ref>, <ref loc="REV 2:8">2.8</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 44:6">Isa 44.6</ref>, <ref loc="ISA 48:12">48.12</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />A kawbya hae kha zui hae zah, hiinnaw thingku kya-e athae aenaw kaw a hoi hae paw te khuapi lungkhu lang koikua hae kyate teenaw kaw a hoi hae paw tuh hythua a ccou hae paw nynh thua.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22.14: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 2:9">Gen 2.9</ref>, <ref loc="GEN 3:22">3.22</ref></char></note> <verse number="15" style="v" />Tuhzemah atolang tuh ui hae, naawthya hae paw, a ohhuakuh hae paw, ccungccaw theih hae paw, zohtuh beik hae paw te hynbya kha sungsah zah a hopaw miakaw nynh a um hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />“Kae, Jesu nynh hynh-e uccaw hae hynh khriccaawbuu hae kya ccaekiakhan sah khylan ka vaaw ccungccapaw kha nae kalan kae saw. Kae tuh David tharui te a ciihan ka thua zah, phaephae akpaw nizy awsi nynh ka thua,” a ci.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22.16: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 11:1">Isa 11.1</ref>, <ref loc="ISA 11:10">10</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Akaepaw liaccanung te</para>
  <para style="q2">Muisaw nynh, “Rang!” a ci hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">A thaepaw ccungccaw nynh, “Rang!” ci sah.</para>
  <para style="q1">A tuihawpaw ccungccaw tuh yn cceih sah.</para>
  <para style="q1">A rypaw ccungccaw tuh</para>
  <para style="q1">hiinnaw tui hynh amee leite lawkuh sah.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22.17: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 55:1">Isa 55.1</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />E ccauh kya a umpaw profehbya hae a thaepaw ccungccaw miakaw kalan kae nynh ccaekia ka khanpaw tuh: Lukhakheit nynh hynh-e uccaw hae hynh a biachih lanze, Pachia nynh tuh-e paw tungvaw kya hynh-e ccauh lungkhu azeikuhpaw shethya hae kha a biachih cih.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22.18-19: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 4:2">Deu 4.2</ref>, <ref loc="DEU 12:32">12.32</ref></char></note> <verse number="19" style="v" />Lukhakheit nynh hynh-e ccauh lungkhu e profehbya hae kha a lawbang lanze, hynh-e ccauh kya azeikuhpaw hiinnaw thingku kyate thuasah, athyaapaw khuapi kyate thuasah Pachia nynh a hanpaw kha a lawpah ru cih.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Hynh-e uccaw hae kong ccaekiakhantupaw nynh, “Thanccingte, kae tuh arangte kae thua vae cih,” a ci.</para>
  <para style="p">Amen. Bawipaw Jesu, yn thua ccavae!</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Bawipaw Jesu a thawccinaw tuh mithyaa hae balyn kya la um sah. Amen.</para>
</usx>